(2107649, 284984, 31742, '<td valign="top">This shot would of been nice in wildlife Awsome!!!!....</td>', 'This shot would of been nice in wildlife Awsome!!!!....', '2006-02-01 00:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107731, 278900, 44996, '<td valign="top">this image is so real and true life, It makes you feel thier emotions. I love it.</td>', 'this image is so real and true life, It makes you feel thier emotions. I love it.', '2006-02-01 00:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107745, 285525, 15711, '<td valign="top">This really stands out with the chartreuse tones of the field against the blue mountains and gray clouds.  Man - I want to go running into that photo.</td>', 'This really stands out with the chartreuse tones of the field against the blue mountains and gray clouds.  Man - I want to go running into that photo.', '2006-02-01 00:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107773, 279935, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, I''d be interested to know what was used for the subject.  The stars and colors really add to this.</td>', 'Nice effect, I''d be interested to know what was used for the subject.  The stars and colors really add to this.', '2006-02-01 00:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107790, 285035, 509, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and composition.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and composition.', '2006-02-01 00:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107799, 278902, 31628, '<td valign="top">Wow.  The fisheye really works here.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Wow.  The fisheye really works here.  Nice capture.', '2006-02-01 00:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107820, 288239, 509, '<td valign="top">A little small (using the maximum 640 px length might make the details more prominent).  The lighting on the face is very well done.  A little more lighting on the hair (from the back maybe) would help separate her hair from the background.  This blending might be intentional but I find myself straining to see the separation.</td>', 'A little small (using the maximum 640 px length might make the details more prominent).  The lighting on the face is very well done.  A little more lighting on the hair (from the back maybe) would help separate her hair from the background.  This blending might be intentional but I find myself straining to see the separation.', '2006-02-01 00:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107832, 283109, 42826, '<td valign="top">great shot...nice color contrast with the flowers...love the lighting too!</td>', 'great shot...nice color contrast with the flowers...love the lighting too!', '2006-02-01 00:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107834, 285929, 509, '<td valign="top">Great subject and composition.  Might benefit from a little more contrast imho.</td>', 'Great subject and composition.  Might benefit from a little more contrast imho.', '2006-02-01 00:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107848, 289221, 41802, '<td valign="top">First shot to reach out and grab me.  Excellent work, the black and white was a great choice.</td>', 'First shot to reach out and grab me.  Excellent work, the black and white was a great choice.', '2006-02-01 00:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107852, 280470, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and colors.  Compositionally might be improved if the upper left corner had the slight darkening that the other 3 corners have.  I like the off-center framing though.</td>', 'I like the lighting and colors.  Compositionally might be improved if the upper left corner had the slight darkening that the other 3 corners have.  I like the off-center framing though.', '2006-02-01 00:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107855, 280032, 31628, '<td valign="top">If this qualifies under the editing rules, then good job - I have no idea how you did this.  However, this seems more like digital art than a photograph to me.</td>', 'If this qualifies under the editing rules, then good job - I have no idea how you did this.  However, this seems more like digital art than a photograph to me.', '2006-02-01 00:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107859, 279774, 5885, '<td valign="top">This is adorable. Nice Saturation and color. Very good Contrast and nice DoF. And, best of all, it''s JUST so CUTE!</td>', 'This is adorable. Nice Saturation and color. Very good Contrast and nice DoF. And, best of all, it''s JUST so CUTE!', '2006-02-01 00:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107860, 286873, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract.</td>', 'Very nice abstract.', '2006-02-01 00:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107880, 287119, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, they''re usually tough to capture this sharp.  The colors are great, but compositionally could be improved if there was some element of his environment (ie, a plant, coral, etc.) to add interest imho.</td>', 'Nice capture, they''re usually tough to capture this sharp.  The colors are great, but compositionally could be improved if there was some element of his environment (ie, a plant, coral, etc.) to add interest imho.', '2006-02-01 00:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107893, 279977, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, particularly with the birds adding to the scene.  The reflection and colors are strong elements as well.  The contrast on the dock might be a little high (the birds and parts of the wood look to be blown out) but otherwise good.</td>', 'Nice capture, particularly with the birds adding to the scene.  The reflection and colors are strong elements as well.  The contrast on the dock might be a little high (the birds and parts of the wood look to be blown out) but otherwise good.', '2006-02-01 01:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107910, 288742, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow excellent work, great lighting and composition.  The bright colors just brought me in.</td>', 'Wow excellent work, great lighting and composition.  The bright colors just brought me in.', '2006-02-01 01:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107911, 288830, 30861, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. A little too much border for me, but not affecting my scoring one bit.</td>', 'Outstanding. A little too much border for me, but not affecting my scoring one bit.', '2006-02-01 01:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107921, 277604, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow this shot stand out! Great use of shadow and light.</td>', 'Wow this shot stand out! Great use of shadow and light.', '2006-02-01 01:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107924, 279990, 16241, '<td valign="top">very nice! i love low light conditions</td>', 'very nice! i love low light conditions', '2006-02-01 01:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107931, 288705, 42826, '<td valign="top">now that looks just like my pups...go take a look, you will see it!  How crazy!  Love the black and white!</td>', 'now that looks just like my pups...go take a look, you will see it!  How crazy!  Love the black and white!', '2006-02-01 01:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107932, 287096, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition; one just wants to keep looking. Nicely exposed -- snow is difficult and youd id a great job with it.</td>', 'Interesting composition; one just wants to keep looking. Nicely exposed -- snow is difficult and youd id a great job with it.', '2006-02-01 01:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107945, 289236, 48524, '<td valign="top">Hi, Laurie.  lol.  Good luck on the sex appeal :)</td>', 'Hi, Laurie.  lol.  Good luck on the sex appeal :)', '2006-02-01 01:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107947, 287725, 47487, '<td valign="top">Teh reflections and the light here are beautiful. Well-composed, too.</td>', 'Teh reflections and the light here are beautiful. Well-composed, too.', '2006-02-01 01:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107949, 278763, 36999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light!  and complete with Rez horses.  Is this the rarely photographed western side of Shiprock?</td>', 'Beautiful light!  and complete with Rez horses.  Is this the rarely photographed western side of Shiprock?', '2006-02-01 01:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107970, 288570, 36470, '<td valign="top">Excellent, ribbon contender, IMO</td>', 'Excellent, ribbon contender, IMO', '2006-02-01 01:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107972, 287111, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but the blown highlights and the bit of the boat do detract from the image, in my opinion. The eye is drawn quite successfully forward by the arching underside of the bridge, but then it''s drawn to something you can''t quite make out because of brightness. I know from experience that this kind of shot is really difficult to expose; your effort here is pretty good. :)</td>', 'Interesting composition, but the blown highlights and the bit of the boat do detract from the image, in my opinion. The eye is drawn quite successfully forward by the arching underside of the bridge, but then it''s drawn to something you can''t quite make out because of brightness. I know from experience that this kind of shot is really difficult to expose; your effort here is pretty good. :)', '2006-02-01 01:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107980, 283882, 50935, '<td valign="top">Very Nice</td>', 'Very Nice', '2006-02-01 01:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107983, 289250, 50935, '<td valign="top">I this setting... except for the fence.</td>', 'I this setting... except for the fence.', '2006-02-01 01:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107987, 287750, 11960, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2006-02-01 01:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2107988, 288619, 47487, '<td valign="top">VERY pretty -- well-exposed, well-composed. Beautiful. 9.</td>', 'VERY pretty -- well-exposed, well-composed. Beautiful. 9.', '2006-02-01 01:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108001, 281129, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice, evocative portrait. Makes me want to know him. Good job!</td>', 'Nice, evocative portrait. Makes me want to know him. Good job!', '2006-02-01 01:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108004, 286880, 509, '<td valign="top">The high key lighting and composition is well done, but the outfit, having more detail and contrast than the model''s face, competes for attention imho.  I''d prefer the eyes to be the strongest focal point here, but that''s just me.</td>', 'The high key lighting and composition is well done, but the outfit, having more detail and contrast than the model''s face, competes for attention imho.  I''d prefer the eyes to be the strongest focal point here, but that''s just me.', '2006-02-01 01:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108008, 289359, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like the relatively shallow dof you used here. The focus is good on the face.</td>', 'I like the relatively shallow dof you used here. The focus is good on the face.', '2006-02-01 01:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108011, 280624, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, kind of depends on the editing for the interest, but it definitely looks illuminated.</td>', 'Nice abstract, kind of depends on the editing for the interest, but it definitely looks illuminated.', '2006-02-01 01:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108016, 287603, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape.  Composition and exposure are strong, as is the level of contrast</td>', 'Nice landscape.  Composition and exposure are strong, as is the level of contrast', '2006-02-01 01:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108031, 282987, 47487, '<td valign="top">Is this smoke? Interesting.</td>', 'Is this smoke? Interesting.', '2006-02-01 01:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108040, 288248, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like reflections, and the bird on top is a nice touch, but I think I''d have maybe liked this a bit better if it was composed with the pole a bit off-center, maybe on a third line with the boat centered.</td>', 'I like reflections, and the bird on top is a nice touch, but I think I''d have maybe liked this a bit better if it was composed with the pole a bit off-center, maybe on a third line with the boat centered.', '2006-02-01 01:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108050, 289132, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice tones</td>', 'nice tones', '2006-02-01 01:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108052, 288255, 28882, '<td valign="top">i like this place. where is it?</td>', 'i like this place. where is it?', '2006-02-01 01:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108056, 283109, 45000, '<td valign="top">Fotoman...this has to be you, I think that''s your model...and it has your "feel" of editing to it.  Wouldn''t it make more sense if the flowers were on the other side?<br/> <br/>:P  Good photo...you get an 8 from me.</td>', 'Fotoman...this has to be you, I think that''s your model...and it has your "feel" of editing to it.  Wouldn''t it make more sense if the flowers were on the other side? :P  Good photo...you get an 8 from me.', '2006-02-01 01:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108070, 289385, 39349, '<td valign="top">Nice Atomic Betas. I have two as coat hangers at work. ;) Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice Atomic Betas. I have two as coat hangers at work. ;) Nice shot!', '2006-02-01 01:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108071, 289221, 47487, '<td valign="top">Wow. Stunning.</td>', 'Wow. Stunning.', '2006-02-01 01:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108074, 289186, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice toning; sepia is a good choice for this shot, I think.</td>', 'Nice toning; sepia is a good choice for this shot, I think.', '2006-02-01 01:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108082, 288691, 47487, '<td valign="top">Fire dancer? Nicely shot. The body (?) behind is difficult to make out and hence causes a bit of distraction but I like the broken, bright lines.</td>', 'Fire dancer? Nicely shot. The body (?) behind is difficult to make out and hence causes a bit of distraction but I like the broken, bright lines.', '2006-02-01 01:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108115, 284493, 31443, '<td valign="top">Dof is not that fantastic but the moment makes up for that many fold, really nice to look at..</td>', 'Dof is not that fantastic but the moment makes up for that many fold, really nice to look at..', '2006-02-01 01:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108133, 289038, 26756, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, the light is soft and flattering.  The white wall in the back is nice and that splash of purple is a nice, feminine color.  Very good job.</td>', 'Nice pose, the light is soft and flattering.  The white wall in the back is nice and that splash of purple is a nice, feminine color.  Very good job.', '2006-02-01 01:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108141, 289087, 26756, '<td valign="top">Like the mood of this shot and also your subject choice. Great color of that coke machine, nice tones throughout.  Processing in the foreground didn''t come off as well as the rest of the pic but the overall shot is very nice.</td>', 'Like the mood of this shot and also your subject choice. Great color of that coke machine, nice tones throughout.  Processing in the foreground didn''t come off as well as the rest of the pic but the overall shot is very nice.', '2006-02-01 01:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108153, 286075, 47487, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too dark. With the foreground dark and the buildings white, the eye''s drawn to the background instead of the intended subjects.</td>', 'It''s a little too dark. With the foreground dark and the buildings white, the eye''s drawn to the background instead of the intended subjects.', '2006-02-01 01:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108162, 285757, 26756, '<td valign="top">Really impressive.  Nice idea, flawlessly done.  You could not have chosen a better background for this.</td>', 'Really impressive.  Nice idea, flawlessly done.  You could not have chosen a better background for this.', '2006-02-01 01:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108185, 288972, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like the light and composition in this shot. It looks a little oversharpened to me, almost pixelated; also, the shiny rocks (?) between the trees are a bit distracting. Still, good seeing.</td>', 'I like the light and composition in this shot. It looks a little oversharpened to me, almost pixelated; also, the shiny rocks (?) between the trees are a bit distracting. Still, good seeing.', '2006-02-01 01:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108197, 280173, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting light! Provocative portrait; I like it.</td>', 'Interesting light! Provocative portrait; I like it.', '2006-02-01 02:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108204, 287488, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture; somehow, though, it just doesn''t work well for me. I keep seeing the distractions rather than the whole image, and the overall yellow toning seems a little bit off. Technically this is a very good photo, and I think it''s just my personal taste that causes me not to like it more. Considering that... 7.</td>', 'Interesting capture; somehow, though, it just doesn''t work well for me. I keep seeing the distractions rather than the whole image, and the overall yellow toning seems a little bit off. Technically this is a very good photo, and I think it''s just my personal taste that causes me not to like it more. Considering that... 7.', '2006-02-01 02:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108209, 284680, 47487, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Nice colors.</td>', 'Pretty. Nice colors.', '2006-02-01 02:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108211, 280544, 47487, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The slow shutter speed makes the water look lovely.</td>', 'Very nice! The slow shutter speed makes the water look lovely.', '2006-02-01 02:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108214, 289113, 47487, '<td valign="top">This seems the tiniest bit... pixelated? to me? The egret''s head seems like it ought to be sharper, based on the rest of the picture, than it is. Nice capture, though.</td>', 'This seems the tiniest bit... pixelated? to me? The egret''s head seems like it ought to be sharper, based on the rest of the picture, than it is. Nice capture, though.', '2006-02-01 02:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108217, 278326, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene. With the light on the woman''s hair and the shadow on the artist''s face, though, the eye isn''t naturally drawn to the subject. Nicely captured, though, and prettily done.</td>', 'Interesting scene. With the light on the woman''s hair and the shadow on the artist''s face, though, the eye isn''t naturally drawn to the subject. Nicely captured, though, and prettily done.', '2006-02-01 02:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2108221, 282524, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, pretty light. I wish the eye hadn''t been in such a harsh shadow, but what can you do. :)</td>', 'Nice composition, pretty light. I wish the eye hadn''t been in such a harsh shadow, but what can you do. :)', '2006-02-01 02:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
