(2108226, 288558, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like this; it''s quite nicely composed. If a levels adjustment could have made the blacks blacker without over-darkening the foreground, that might have made it even better. 7</td>', 'I like this; it''s quite nicely composed. If a levels adjustment could have made the blacks blacker without over-darkening the foreground, that might have made it even better. 7', '2006-02-01 02:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
