(2109343, 277008, 39062, '<td valign="top">Could be a little sharper. More than likely taken with a high zoom. Suggestion is to increase the ISO speed of the camera. If possible then use a tripod and drop the shutter speed but if hand held you will need to raise the shutter speed to 1/(effective focal length). Whatever shutter speed you need to increas e the f stop to give greater depth of field on this one, as ever its a trade off.</td>', 'Could be a little sharper. More than likely taken with a high zoom. Suggestion is to increase the ISO speed of the camera. If possible then use a tripod and drop the shutter speed but if hand held you will need to raise the shutter speed to 1/(effective focal length). Whatever shutter speed you need to increas e the f stop to give greater depth of field on this one, as ever its a trade off.', '2006-02-01 08:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
