(2110121, 287315, 47117, '<td valign="top">I think its time to get another outfit?  I think this one is over used.  Maybe a new hairdo from "Fallen Angel" would be better too. I''ll give you creativity though, and nice acting on your model''s part; however, not liking you giving up anonymity in the most recent challenges with this theme since your recent win. It may be time to try something new.</td>', 'I think its time to get another outfit?  I think this one is over used.  Maybe a new hairdo from "Fallen Angel" would be better too. I''ll give you creativity though, and nice acting on your model''s part; however, not liking you giving up anonymity in the most recent challenges with this theme since your recent win. It may be time to try something new.', '2006-02-01 11:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110125, 285921, 46735, '<td valign="top">beautiful sunset and I must say that the picture is a real nice one. but if the man and the forground was just a bit lighter it would realy set the picture off (I mean light enuff not to change your ideal but just enuff not to make the picture seem as if it is underexposed). I think you will get a good rating on this one.</td>', 'beautiful sunset and I must say that the picture is a real nice one. but if the man and the forground was just a bit lighter it would realy set the picture off (I mean light enuff not to change your ideal but just enuff not to make the picture seem as if it is underexposed). I think you will get a good rating on this one.', '2006-02-01 11:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110128, 285997, 47117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice capture, but having the subject facing out of the frame is not good technique.  You needed another angle here, but I do like the tones and the capture.</td>', 'This is a nice capture, but having the subject facing out of the frame is not good technique.  You needed another angle here, but I do like the tones and the capture.', '2006-02-01 11:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110134, 285757, 15711, '<td valign="top">Elsapo!!!!!  Sure is a cool image.  I can''t wait to find out how you did it!  Great - imaginative.</td>', 'Elsapo!!!!!  Sure is a cool image.  I can''t wait to find out how you did it!  Great - imaginative.', '2006-02-01 11:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
