(2110193, 288396, 47117, '<td valign="top">I can''t see one person in focus here. Looks like a good time though.</td>', 'I can''t see one person in focus here. Looks like a good time though.', '2006-02-01 11:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110198, 287488, 47117, '<td valign="top">It is so funny to see this after just having the last picture be the white cat that looks similar in facial expression. LOL...You are much prettier though :)</td>', 'It is so funny to see this after just having the last picture be the white cat that looks similar in facial expression. LOL...You are much prettier though :)', '2006-02-01 11:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110213, 284984, 47117, '<td valign="top">HAHAHA, what ODD looking monkiys.  Love the colors in this and the capture. A 9.</td>', 'HAHAHA, what ODD looking monkiys.  Love the colors in this and the capture. A 9.', '2006-02-01 11:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110214, 287509, 30608, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful capture! You can almost hear the deep growl. Excellent composition! 10</td>', 'What a beautiful capture! You can almost hear the deep growl. Excellent composition! 10', '2006-02-01 11:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110228, 288950, 35044, '<td valign="top">I love this effect.  I get something similar by dropping the yellows in post, but I would be very interested in your post processing method.  The minimalist design of the building is well complemented by your post processing, though the detail in the trees and the bikes on the RHS detract from this a very little.<br/> <br/>Overall, one of my favourites.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love this effect.  I get something similar by dropping the yellows in post, but I would be very interested in your post processing method.  The minimalist design of the building is well complemented by your post processing, though the detail in the trees and the bikes on the RHS detract from this a very little. Overall, one of my favourites.  Good luck!', '2006-02-01 11:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110245, 288395, 34013, '<td valign="top">gorgeous lighting</td>', 'gorgeous lighting', '2006-02-01 11:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110253, 289372, 46735, '<td valign="top">Great composition, good subject. If the picture was more in focus you would get a highter score from the members. the softness of the picture looks more as if it is a little out of focus than a picture with a softfocus len or filter. But I think you will still get a good rating out of this one.</td>', 'Great composition, good subject. If the picture was more in focus you would get a highter score from the members. the softness of the picture looks more as if it is a little out of focus than a picture with a softfocus len or filter. But I think you will still get a good rating out of this one.', '2006-02-01 11:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110259, 287715, 46735, '<td valign="top">great sky</td>', 'great sky', '2006-02-01 11:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110261, 285757, 47117, '<td valign="top">Lot of portals going on. Mine was one in the Fantasy challenge and I have seen quite a few since. :)  This one I like a lot. An 8.</td>', 'Lot of portals going on. Mine was one in the Fantasy challenge and I have seen quite a few since. :)  This one I like a lot. An 8.', '2006-02-01 11:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110265, 286790, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think I would have done a selective color adjustment to un-pink the white of the stripes - otherwise a very good image! 7</td>', 'I think I would have done a selective color adjustment to un-pink the white of the stripes - otherwise a very good image! 7', '2006-02-01 11:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110267, 288936, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the green of the border detracts from it. I like the single plant and even the color, but not in the border.</td>', 'I think the green of the border detracts from it. I like the single plant and even the color, but not in the border.', '2006-02-01 11:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110270, 280793, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great leading line.  I like the overall gray/blue sense of it.  Very pretty with the touches of reddish brown and tan. 7</td>', 'Very nice.  Great leading line.  I like the overall gray/blue sense of it.  Very pretty with the touches of reddish brown and tan. 7', '2006-02-01 11:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110278, 288637, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is great. I can see this in an art magazine or coffee table book.  Really well done!  Nice use of black and white - I think it''s the only way to go with this image. Wonderful contrast. 10</td>', 'This is great. I can see this in an art magazine or coffee table book.  Really well done!  Nice use of black and white - I think it''s the only way to go with this image. Wonderful contrast. 10', '2006-02-01 11:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110284, 289245, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this could really be enriched by an adjustment of curves or levels.  It''s pretty- the composition is good, but it is kind of pale to my eye. 7</td>', 'I think this could really be enriched by an adjustment of curves or levels.  It''s pretty- the composition is good, but it is kind of pale to my eye. 7', '2006-02-01 11:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110287, 287200, 46735, '<td valign="top">You use the right medium (black &amp; white) because I don''t think the the picture would not have had the same affect and beauty. Nice looking lady</td>', 'You use the right medium (black & white) because I don''t think the the picture would not have had the same affect and beauty. Nice looking lady', '2006-02-01 11:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110290, 279760, 15711, '<td valign="top">The ol'' 57 Bel Aire! My folks had an aqua station wagon. I still remember it.<br/> <br/>This has nice colors and the perspective is interesting.  I think the trees behind it kind of detract. In a perfect scenario, this car would be all alone or perhaps in an unusual setting like a barren field.</td>', 'The ol'' 57 Bel Aire! My folks had an aqua station wagon. I still remember it. This has nice colors and the perspective is interesting.  I think the trees behind it kind of detract. In a perfect scenario, this car would be all alone or perhaps in an unusual setting like a barren field.', '2006-02-01 11:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110292, 284806, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH WOW.  Really emotive.</td>', 'OH WOW.  Really emotive.', '2006-02-01 11:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110294, 288239, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I wish you''d utilized the maximum 640 pixelation so we could see her better. The skin and lighting is very nice, but it''s so small. ;~(</td>', 'Very nice. I wish you''d utilized the maximum 640 pixelation so we could see her better. The skin and lighting is very nice, but it''s so small. ;~(', '2006-02-01 11:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110297, 288830, 15711, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT! Reminescent of a Richard Avedon portrait. Really great detail and the contrasts and lighting - WOW The eyes are perfect, which is sometimes hard with glasses!  BRAVO !!!!!  10</td>', 'EXCELLENT! Reminescent of a Richard Avedon portrait. Really great detail and the contrasts and lighting - WOW The eyes are perfect, which is sometimes hard with glasses!  BRAVO !!!!!  10', '2006-02-01 11:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110301, 288498, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think with some tweaking of the contrast, this has real potential.  It''s just a bit too dull as it is. I like the composition and the leading line.</td>', 'I think with some tweaking of the contrast, this has real potential.  It''s just a bit too dull as it is. I like the composition and the leading line.', '2006-02-01 11:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110303, 282524, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  I wish the eye didn''t seem sunken, but that''s my only nitpick. Love the light and dark.  The focus is tack sharp.</td>', 'Wonderful.  I wish the eye didn''t seem sunken, but that''s my only nitpick. Love the light and dark.  The focus is tack sharp.', '2006-02-01 11:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
