(2110306, 285010, 15711, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT! The softness of his fur.  Beautiful detailing.  The light really showcases his gorgeous face. Perfect use of a black background too. GOOD KITTY!! 9</td>', 'EXCELLENT! The softness of his fur.  Beautiful detailing.  The light really showcases his gorgeous face. Perfect use of a black background too. GOOD KITTY!! 9', '2006-02-01 11:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
