(2110439, 284241, 47487, '<td valign="top">You know, this has the makings of a lovely scene. I personally am not a fan of purposeful tilt without a really good reason -- was the purpose here to contrast the jarring tilt with the serene scene? It really takes away from an otherwise beautiful picture for me. Just my opinion.</td>', 'You know, this has the makings of a lovely scene. I personally am not a fan of purposeful tilt without a really good reason -- was the purpose here to contrast the jarring tilt with the serene scene? It really takes away from an otherwise beautiful picture for me. Just my opinion.', '2006-02-01 12:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2110444, 281550, 47487, '<td valign="top">Ooh, nice. Wow. I have to scroll a bit to see the vertical images and to come to that tree with the ray of light -- it was almost breathtaking.</td>', 'Ooh, nice. Wow. I have to scroll a bit to see the vertical images and to come to that tree with the ray of light -- it was almost breathtaking.', '2006-02-01 12:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
