(2111470, 288300, 39144, '<td valign="top">What a great photograph. The exposure and setup is awesome, and the selective desaturation very complimentay to the photo. I wish I could learn to set up lighting as well as you did here. -10</td>', 'What a great photograph. The exposure and setup is awesome, and the selective desaturation very complimentay to the photo. I wish I could learn to set up lighting as well as you did here. -10', '2006-02-01 17:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
