(2111717, 288683, 13077, '<td valign="top">Great focus and DOF, and I like the vivid colors and the lighting of the bird''s eye. I had to look up that word to see what the title meant :P</td>', 'Great focus and DOF, and I like the vivid colors and the lighting of the bird''s eye. I had to look up that word to see what the title meant :P', '2006-02-01 18:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111722, 284228, 40019, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, but it''s a little busy with the buildings in the background.  If the subject is the lights, you would want to isolate them more in the picture to make them stand out.  For instance, it looks like there is some open sky to the right - if you positioned yourself a little to the left, you may have been able to isolate the lights against the open sky. If you wanted to keep the juxtaposition with the buildings, then doing the above in landscape mode may have achieved the proper affect.</td>', 'Interesting picture, but it''s a little busy with the buildings in the background.  If the subject is the lights, you would want to isolate them more in the picture to make them stand out.  For instance, it looks like there is some open sky to the right - if you positioned yourself a little to the left, you may have been able to isolate the lights against the open sky. If you wanted to keep the juxtaposition with the buildings, then doing the above in landscape mode may have achieved the proper affect.', '2006-02-01 18:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2111724, 289115, 40019, '<td valign="top">Ah, but you need a thorn somewhere in the pic!  :-)</td>', 'Ah, but you need a thorn somewhere in the pic!  :-)', '2006-02-01 18:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
