(2111783, 278357, 8860, '<td valign="top">Love the scene here. This would be near perfect had you achieved hyperfocus by focussing 2/3 of the way back into your shot with f16 or there abouts. This would have allowed your background to be crisply in focus too. You may of course know this but couldn''t bear not to submit this lovely shot despite it! Who knows?...<br/> <br/>Very well composed and a beautiful time of day.</td>', 'Love the scene here. This would be near perfect had you achieved hyperfocus by focussing 2/3 of the way back into your shot with f16 or there abouts. This would have allowed your background to be crisply in focus too. You may of course know this but couldn''t bear not to submit this lovely shot despite it! Who knows?... Very well composed and a beautiful time of day.', '2006-02-01 18:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
