(2112060, 283938, 12253, '<td valign="top">Now that''s very funny.  Good tones, but you should have perhaps matched the other shots and been neked (without revealing anything); the belt and underware detract from an artistically funny shot.</td>', 'Now that''s very funny.  Good tones, but you should have perhaps matched the other shots and been neked (without revealing anything); the belt and underware detract from an artistically funny shot.', '2006-02-01 19:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112063, 283643, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great title, cause that''s what it is - classic.  Great lighting and DOF. I like that you did not clone or Neat Image away some of the imperfections in teh skin - makes it a "real" picture.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Great title, cause that''s what it is - classic.  Great lighting and DOF. I like that you did not clone or Neat Image away some of the imperfections in teh skin - makes it a "real" picture.  Very nicely done!', '2006-02-01 19:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112065, 287345, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so magical.  It looks great on the thumbnail. . .but the thumbnail doesn''t nearly do it justice because when you open it up, it made my heart jump.  The lights in the background add so much beauty to this.  Not to mention the natural, wonderful look of pure love on their faces.</td>', 'This is so magical.  It looks great on the thumbnail. . .but the thumbnail doesn''t nearly do it justice because when you open it up, it made my heart jump.  The lights in the background add so much beauty to this.  Not to mention the natural, wonderful look of pure love on their faces.', '2006-02-01 19:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
