(2113025, 280444, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a stunning photo!  I love the rich colors, and the razor sharp focus on those birds.   I can really visualize this photo in an elegant brown frame hanging on the wall of a man''s rich-looking office!   This is going right to my favorites folder 10!</td>', 'What a stunning photo!  I love the rich colors, and the razor sharp focus on those birds.   I can really visualize this photo in an elegant brown frame hanging on the wall of a man''s rich-looking office!   This is going right to my favorites folder 10!', '2006-02-01 23:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
