(2113086, 288153, 12253, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors, beautiful shot.</td>', 'Fantastic colors, beautiful shot.', '2006-02-01 23:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113098, 287897, 30608, '<td valign="top">Congratulations in jumping into the "Free Study". The good thing about free studies is you have the freedom to come up with ANY idea and present it to everybody. As with any sport or hobby it takes lots of practice and study to archive good scores. I am afraid that the voters may not take good notice of this entry since they are tending to appreciate more of the upbeat photos. Don''t be discouraged. Be encouraged to study what others are doing. I have no idea what type of equipment you have, but learn everything you can about your camera and what it can do for you. It is amazing what you can do with the simplest of cameras.</td>', 'Congratulations in jumping into the "Free Study". The good thing about free studies is you have the freedom to come up with ANY idea and present it to everybody. As with any sport or hobby it takes lots of practice and study to archive good scores. I am afraid that the voters may not take good notice of this entry since they are tending to appreciate more of the upbeat photos. Don''t be discouraged. Be encouraged to study what others are doing. I have no idea what type of equipment you have, but learn everything you can about your camera and what it can do for you. It is amazing what you can do with the simplest of cameras.', '2006-02-01 23:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113100, 280264, 27073, '<td valign="top">I like it..</td>', 'I like it..', '2006-02-01 23:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113102, 287537, 26313, '<td valign="top">Shit! I just wrote a bloody long comment here, and the damned thing timed out on me and I lost it. I will attempt to recreate it...<br/>I could argue about the ''isolated'' bit, but then, I know the context... Trying hard to think of it <i>out</i> of context, yeah I guess it fits the bill. The upper portion of the image adds nothing, and I''m not very fond of the fence. If I scroll down such that the left-most bit of fence is just about to the top (and the other section just about out of the frame) I think it''s a little better. I''m having a little trouble with the detail. I''m not sure if it''s a focus issue, a sharpening issue, or a simple matter of the resizing (it <i>is</i> a lot of detail to try to cram into 640px). The rocks look good, but there are bits of the houses that look a little soft, and bits that look a little jagged around the edges. Maybe I''m just looking too closely. In that sense, it might be better to zoom in a little closer so that I can clearly see some of the detail I want to see, or maybe out further so that I''m not as tempted by tantalizing detail that I <i>know</i> should be there. Okay, I''m done criticizing--it <i>is</i> a nice shot! I''d love to see it tomorrow under all that snow (have hardly seen a bloody flake in ON since Christmas).</td>', 'Shit! I just wrote a bloody long comment here, and the damned thing timed out on me and I lost it. I will attempt to recreate it...I could argue about the ''isolated'' bit, but then, I know the context... Trying hard to think of it out of context, yeah I guess it fits the bill. The upper portion of the image adds nothing, and I''m not very fond of the fence. If I scroll down such that the left-most bit of fence is just about to the top (and the other section just about out of the frame) I think it''s a little better. I''m having a little trouble with the detail. I''m not sure if it''s a focus issue, a sharpening issue, or a simple matter of the resizing (it is a lot of detail to try to cram into 640px). The rocks look good, but there are bits of the houses that look a little soft, and bits that look a little jagged around the edges. Maybe I''m just looking too closely. In that sense, it might be better to zoom in a little closer so that I can clearly see some of the detail I want to see, or maybe out further so that I''m not as tempted by tantalizing detail that I know should be there. Okay, I''m done criticizing--it is a nice shot! I''d love to see it tomorrow under all that snow (have hardly seen a bloody flake in ON since Christmas).', '2006-02-01 23:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113103, 288204, 27073, '<td valign="top">Cool look.</td>', 'Cool look.', '2006-02-01 23:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113108, 286247, 27073, '<td valign="top">A lot of action in this one! Looks like civil war times.</td>', 'A lot of action in this one! Looks like civil war times.', '2006-02-01 23:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113143, 280032, 41522, '<td valign="top">This has gone beyonf photo and into the realm of digital art.  While there is nothing wrong with that in the right venue, I don''t feel this is the right venue.  JMO.</td>', 'This has gone beyonf photo and into the realm of digital art.  While there is nothing wrong with that in the right venue, I don''t feel this is the right venue.  JMO.', '2006-02-01 23:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113150, 276358, 24983, '<td valign="top">I like the composotion it comes to meet you  10</td>', 'I like the composotion it comes to meet you  10', '2006-02-01 23:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113152, 283450, 47704, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Please post your post-challenge processing.  I''ve love to know how to do this effect.  10</td>', 'I love this.  Please post your post-challenge processing.  I''ve love to know how to do this effect.  10', '2006-02-02 00:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113153, 288395, 41522, '<td valign="top">Cure composition. Nice tones.  I think it might have been oversharpened based on the white marks around the toe nails.  JMO.</td>', 'Cure composition. Nice tones.  I think it might have been oversharpened based on the white marks around the toe nails.  JMO.', '2006-02-02 00:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113159, 280133, 41522, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what has happened in your processing, but the amount of noise in the shot is distracting.  Sometimes image grain can be an added bonus to an image, but I feel that it is misplaced in this case.  JMO.</td>', 'I''m not sure what has happened in your processing, but the amount of noise in the shot is distracting.  Sometimes image grain can be an added bonus to an image, but I feel that it is misplaced in this case.  JMO.', '2006-02-02 00:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113163, 278763, 41522, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and wonderful light.  You have to be pleased that you had some clouds to add a little interest to the sky.  Good work.</td>', 'Nicely composed and wonderful light.  You have to be pleased that you had some clouds to add a little interest to the sky.  Good work.', '2006-02-02 00:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113164, 287981, 70, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, super image. Love the detail in the silhouette and the way he''s standing right in front of the lightbeam source.</td>', 'Oh wow, super image. Love the detail in the silhouette and the way he''s standing right in front of the lightbeam source.', '2006-02-02 00:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113166, 288937, 41522, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture.  Excellent texture details.  I like the sense of protectiveness that the image presents.  As I was typing the word protective, I thought I would look at the title ... Your shot presents it without the title.  Good work!!!</td>', 'Awesome capture.  Excellent texture details.  I like the sense of protectiveness that the image presents.  As I was typing the word protective, I thought I would look at the title ... Your shot presents it without the title.  Good work!!!', '2006-02-02 00:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113168, 286055, 70, '<td valign="top">Great facial expression. Not particularly a fan of the selective desat, though.</td>', 'Great facial expression. Not particularly a fan of the selective desat, though.', '2006-02-02 00:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113172, 285010, 70, '<td valign="top">A bird? Some fish? :)<br/> <br/>Nice post and great detail in the fur. Gives it a great soft feeling without being soft itself. There''s a little shadow in the eye on the right (his left) that I would like to see lightened.</td>', 'A bird? Some fish? :) Nice post and great detail in the fur. Gives it a great soft feeling without being soft itself. There''s a little shadow in the eye on the right (his left) that I would like to see lightened.', '2006-02-02 00:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113176, 288124, 70, '<td valign="top">Lol. His mom thinks so anyway. Nice shot. I like the reflections in the eyes and it''s got a good DOF. I''d like the face a little farther up in the frame so that it doesn''t feel clipped at the..umm..chin? Jowl? Neck? Whatever. :)</td>', 'Lol. His mom thinks so anyway. Nice shot. I like the reflections in the eyes and it''s got a good DOF. I''d like the face a little farther up in the frame so that it doesn''t feel clipped at the..umm..chin? Jowl? Neck? Whatever. :)', '2006-02-02 00:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113179, 283148, 70, '<td valign="top">Love the color and the composition. A bit too much grain, I think, at least in the lighter parts.</td>', 'Love the color and the composition. A bit too much grain, I think, at least in the lighter parts.', '2006-02-02 00:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113189, 288248, 70, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image...if only it weren''t for the stick in the mud! Gorgeous lighting and nice processing here but the stick feels like it''s dividing an otherwise perfectly serene image. Not much you can do about that, I suppose, but maybe compose so that it''s not dead-center?</td>', 'This is a beautiful image...if only it weren''t for the stick in the mud! Gorgeous lighting and nice processing here but the stick feels like it''s dividing an otherwise perfectly serene image. Not much you can do about that, I suppose, but maybe compose so that it''s not dead-center?', '2006-02-02 00:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113191, 288593, 70, '<td valign="top">This is a really cute shot but I''m not really a fan of the fade/border thing.</td>', 'This is a really cute shot but I''m not really a fan of the fade/border thing.', '2006-02-02 00:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113195, 288605, 70, '<td valign="top">I love how this shot makes something that might otherwise seem boring so interesting. Perfect lighting and excellent detail.</td>', 'I love how this shot makes something that might otherwise seem boring so interesting. Perfect lighting and excellent detail.', '2006-02-02 00:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113200, 279826, 47704, '<td valign="top">horrible lighting and contrast.  2</td>', 'horrible lighting and contrast.  2', '2006-02-02 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
