(2113266, 289126, 70, '<td valign="top">This makes me happy that I don''t live in Wyoming. It gives such a feeling of expanse and of windy cold.</td>', 'This makes me happy that I don''t live in Wyoming. It gives such a feeling of expanse and of windy cold.', '2006-02-02 00:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
