(2113434, 286454, 4767, '<td valign="top">I LOVE those shots of the Swedish fish swimming upstream to spawn!  How they jump up the falls and are so darned deterined!  Good capture!  This should be in National Geographic or the Smithsonian Magazine or something!  10</td>', 'I LOVE those shots of the Swedish fish swimming upstream to spawn!  How they jump up the falls and are so darned deterined!  Good capture!  This should be in National Geographic or the Smithsonian Magazine or something!  10', '2006-02-02 01:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113435, 285035, 4767, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo!  What is in her right hand?  Is it a Beretta to off the James Bond type stud?  And he''ll fight her off with only his half-open umbrella, right?  I LOVE judging photos when there''s a real story behind them!</td>', 'Awesome photo!  What is in her right hand?  Is it a Beretta to off the James Bond type stud?  And he''ll fight her off with only his half-open umbrella, right?  I LOVE judging photos when there''s a real story behind them!', '2006-02-02 01:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
