(2113441, 287949, 4767, '<td valign="top">Carrying your reflector, or is this a new lighting technique?  Seems to work effectively either way.  Nice lighting  on the face, Interesting image</td>', 'Carrying your reflector, or is this a new lighting technique?  Seems to work effectively either way.  Nice lighting  on the face, Interesting image', '2006-02-02 01:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
