(2114359, 289002, 42456, '<td valign="top">I like the yellow and blue combination. The foreground rocks are a bit distracting at the bottom but the detail in the image is excellent. The lights at the base of the mountain don''t appear in the reflection of the water. The reflection may or may not appear in the original but as it stands adds to the overall appeal of the image. All things considered, just a great capture. Ten.</td>', 'I like the yellow and blue combination. The foreground rocks are a bit distracting at the bottom but the detail in the image is excellent. The lights at the base of the mountain don''t appear in the reflection of the water. The reflection may or may not appear in the original but as it stands adds to the overall appeal of the image. All things considered, just a great capture. Ten.', '2006-02-02 11:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
