(2114368, 289188, 42456, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the title...I might have used ''Winter Tree'' or ''Winter Colors''. I would of liked the tree moved a bit closer to center and backed out a little bit on the composition to add more of the gorgeous colors of the sky to the image. I think overall this has a chance at a ribbon. I gave it an eight.</td>', 'I don''t care for the title...I might have used ''Winter Tree'' or ''Winter Colors''. I would of liked the tree moved a bit closer to center and backed out a little bit on the composition to add more of the gorgeous colors of the sky to the image. I think overall this has a chance at a ribbon. I gave it an eight.', '2006-02-02 11:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114417, 288683, 42456, '<td valign="top">I think ''stare down'' would have been a better title for the image. I would have liked to have seen less depth of field to bring the beak into sharp focus with the head and to bring the feather line at the edges of the bird into focus adding a bit more detail. I also would have used the burn tool to darken the light area along the feathers on the upper right of the image. <br/>area of the bird. IMO. All in all though, this is a very good image! I gave it a seven.</td>', 'I think ''stare down'' would have been a better title for the image. I would have liked to have seen less depth of field to bring the beak into sharp focus with the head and to bring the feather line at the edges of the bird into focus adding a bit more detail. I also would have used the burn tool to darken the light area along the feathers on the upper right of the image. area of the bird. IMO. All in all though, this is a very good image! I gave it a seven.', '2006-02-02 12:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114434, 287636, 10867, '<td valign="top">You captured the eagle, and the composition of your shot is good.  Unfortuantely, the image is overexposed and not quite as sharp as it could be.  Probably, you didn''t have time to change your settings when this wonderful photo op presented itself.  In any case, this would be a difficult shot to expose correctly because of the very strong contrasts involved.</td>', 'You captured the eagle, and the composition of your shot is good.  Unfortuantely, the image is overexposed and not quite as sharp as it could be.  Probably, you didn''t have time to change your settings when this wonderful photo op presented itself.  In any case, this would be a difficult shot to expose correctly because of the very strong contrasts involved.', '2006-02-02 12:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
