(2114610, 284851, 10867, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s just me, but I think that this image would have been stronger if you hadn''t softened all of the face but the eyes.  That treatment works very well for glamour shots and "flattering" portrait shots, but it seems to me that the unsoftened "truth" is what this image--especially with the title you''ve given it--needed.  The image is still effective, but I think it could have been even more so.</td>', 'I guess it''s just me, but I think that this image would have been stronger if you hadn''t softened all of the face but the eyes.  That treatment works very well for glamour shots and "flattering" portrait shots, but it seems to me that the unsoftened "truth" is what this image--especially with the title you''ve given it--needed.  The image is still effective, but I think it could have been even more so.', '2006-02-02 12:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114614, 288974, 52535, '<td valign="top">awesome!</td>', 'awesome!', '2006-02-02 12:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
