(2114820, 288742, 10867, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, expression and pose and wonderful colours.  I find the fact that the iris of the eye on my left is so light--and so different in colour from the other eye--detracts from the beauty of the image.  This is probably what the camera saw, but darkening the eye would increase the image''s appeal, I think.</td>', 'Beautiful model, expression and pose and wonderful colours.  I find the fact that the iris of the eye on my left is so light--and so different in colour from the other eye--detracts from the beauty of the image.  This is probably what the camera saw, but darkening the eye would increase the image''s appeal, I think.', '2006-02-02 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114860, 282986, 51873, '<td valign="top">Great idea!! nice photot :D</td>', 'Great idea!! nice photot :D', '2006-02-02 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114862, 287072, 10867, '<td valign="top">Your title says "shadows", but I don''t really see any shadows.  The image is attractive, but its title is misleading.</td>', 'Your title says "shadows", but I don''t really see any shadows.  The image is attractive, but its title is misleading.', '2006-02-02 14:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114865, 276743, 50217, '<td valign="top">Extremely refreshing :)</td>', 'Extremely refreshing :)', '2006-02-02 14:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114871, 288767, 31831, '<td valign="top">wonderful capture. great DOF. good luck.</td>', 'wonderful capture. great DOF. good luck.', '2006-02-02 14:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114913, 288742, 48456, '<td valign="top">wow this is almost magical. nice work!</td>', 'wow this is almost magical. nice work!', '2006-02-02 14:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114954, 288396, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I love the sense of motion and energy in it. Looks like a zoom blur, works really well in this.</td>', 'Very nice photo. I love the sense of motion and energy in it. Looks like a zoom blur, works really well in this.', '2006-02-02 14:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114960, 283626, 43148, '<td valign="top">the lightning makes a great backdrop for the lights on the roadway and the city lights, MAYBE a little more cropped off the right side to eliminate the white light there would help, my opinion only, we know</td>', 'the lightning makes a great backdrop for the lights on the roadway and the city lights, MAYBE a little more cropped off the right side to eliminate the white light there would help, my opinion only, we know', '2006-02-02 14:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114964, 287093, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the lighting for the most part, but it seems like the focus is on the strands of hair in front, which is unfortunate since the DOF is as shallow as it is.</td>', 'I like the composition and the lighting for the most part, but it seems like the focus is on the strands of hair in front, which is unfortunate since the DOF is as shallow as it is.', '2006-02-02 14:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114966, 287232, 43148, '<td valign="top">I do not like the border on here, but that is my opinion only, like the shot very much otherwise</td>', 'I do not like the border on here, but that is my opinion only, like the shot very much otherwise', '2006-02-02 14:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114969, 287540, 43148, '<td valign="top">appears to be a little soft on focus, lovely capture otherwise</td>', 'appears to be a little soft on focus, lovely capture otherwise', '2006-02-02 14:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114974, 289250, 43148, '<td valign="top">did not like the fence at first, but looking at it more, decided it adds to the "mood" of this photo, nicely done IMO</td>', 'did not like the fence at first, but looking at it more, decided it adds to the "mood" of this photo, nicely done IMO', '2006-02-02 14:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114981, 279947, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Although I don''t know that I care for the green tint of the lighting much, the composition and lighting are very good. Might look very nice in BW also.</td>', 'Nice photo. Although I don''t know that I care for the green tint of the lighting much, the composition and lighting are very good. Might look very nice in BW also.', '2006-02-02 14:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114984, 281211, 43753, '<td valign="top">I liek the lighting, but it almost makes the mouth disappear. THe expression is funny.</td>', 'I liek the lighting, but it almost makes the mouth disappear. THe expression is funny.', '2006-02-02 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114988, 289381, 43753, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at the detail in the feathers!!! That is so beautiful. I love the reflection in those big dark eyes too. Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Wow, look at the detail in the feathers!!! That is so beautiful. I love the reflection in those big dark eyes too. Beautiful capture.', '2006-02-02 15:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114991, 280772, 9668, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting on this. How the light in thebackground travels right through it. I think it might be a bit better composition if it was cropped so that it was more ont he rule of thirds interesection. Like the wieghtlessness of it though, overall - awsome image!</td>', 'Like the lighting on this. How the light in thebackground travels right through it. I think it might be a bit better composition if it was cropped so that it was more ont he rule of thirds interesection. Like the wieghtlessness of it though, overall - awsome image!', '2006-02-02 15:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114993, 285948, 43753, '<td valign="top">Ah, taking a little nap. Look how the decorative cut-out behind him almost looks like a silhouette. Seems like there sre signs everywhere!!</td>', 'Ah, taking a little nap. Look how the decorative cut-out behind him almost looks like a silhouette. Seems like there sre signs everywhere!!', '2006-02-02 15:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114996, 288199, 43753, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a man in a cgorilla suit doesn''t it? Nice wildlife shot. Did you selective color the green or something. It almost looks too green.</td>', 'Almost looks like a man in a cgorilla suit doesn''t it? Nice wildlife shot. Did you selective color the green or something. It almost looks too green.', '2006-02-02 15:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114997, 282986, 43148, '<td valign="top">imo (ONLY) border is too close to subject, otherwise nicely done</td>', 'imo (ONLY) border is too close to subject, otherwise nicely done', '2006-02-02 15:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114999, 277140, 43753, '<td valign="top">I really like how half of the face is shrouded in shadow. Very cool looking. Lots of nice contrast without blowing out the highlighs. Nice sharpness around the eye.</td>', 'I really like how half of the face is shrouded in shadow. Very cool looking. Lots of nice contrast without blowing out the highlighs. Nice sharpness around the eye.', '2006-02-02 15:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115000, 285537, 43148, '<td valign="top">colors look more realistic in reflection than on the original objects IMO</td>', 'colors look more realistic in reflection than on the original objects IMO', '2006-02-02 15:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115002, 281124, 43753, '<td valign="top">Aww! i think he (or she) wanted to go home with you. I almost hate to see these little guys behind a fence. I like how you captured the colors in the face, the pink around thoue big brown eyes, and the different shades in the fur. Great detail.</td>', 'Aww! i think he (or she) wanted to go home with you. I almost hate to see these little guys behind a fence. I like how you captured the colors in the face, the pink around thoue big brown eyes, and the different shades in the fur. Great detail.', '2006-02-02 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115005, 287636, 43753, '<td valign="top">This is a little too fuzzy, and the highlights are a little blown-out. I still think it is a nice composition.</td>', 'This is a little too fuzzy, and the highlights are a little blown-out. I still think it is a nice composition.', '2006-02-02 15:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115007, 288598, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and composition of this, and good exposure. The sky seems a little bright, but at least the snow is white. I like the contrast of the wood against the snow/sky also.</td>', 'I like the angle and composition of this, and good exposure. The sky seems a little bright, but at least the snow is white. I like the contrast of the wood against the snow/sky also.', '2006-02-02 15:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115009, 289186, 43753, '<td valign="top">Now this is a really neat image. I love the emptiness.</td>', 'Now this is a really neat image. I love the emptiness.', '2006-02-02 15:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115013, 288834, 43753, '<td valign="top">The subjects are positioned a little too far over to the left side of the frame. I really like the perspective. Nice detail.</td>', 'The subjects are positioned a little too far over to the left side of the frame. I really like the perspective. Nice detail.', '2006-02-02 15:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115018, 288257, 43753, '<td valign="top">Everything about this image is beautiful EXCEPT the tree. I am not a fan of cloning out major elements though. I think the water movement is so well captured - darn tree!</td>', 'Everything about this image is beautiful EXCEPT the tree. I am not a fan of cloning out major elements though. I think the water movement is so well captured - darn tree!', '2006-02-02 15:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115023, 288525, 43753, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and angle. Nice capture with the letters partially obscured by the soil.</td>', 'I like the DOF and angle. Nice capture with the letters partially obscured by the soil.', '2006-02-02 15:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115027, 280509, 43753, '<td valign="top">Excellent reflection - I love the rings created by the rain drops.</td>', 'Excellent reflection - I love the rings created by the rain drops.', '2006-02-02 15:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115032, 287828, 43753, '<td valign="top">I love the color scheme. I think cropping out more of the right side of the image would look better.</td>', 'I love the color scheme. I think cropping out more of the right side of the image would look better.', '2006-02-02 15:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115037, 279701, 43753, '<td valign="top">ROFL!!!! This is soooo very funny. What an excellent capture. He''s sticking his tongue out at us!!!!</td>', 'ROFL!!!! This is soooo very funny. What an excellent capture. He''s sticking his tongue out at us!!!!', '2006-02-02 15:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115045, 279777, 43753, '<td valign="top">Everything about this image is lovely except for the grass. It really detracts from the girl. Her hair looks so pretty in the sun. The way the breeze lifts her hair up without really blowing it looks really great.</td>', 'Everything about this image is lovely except for the grass. It really detracts from the girl. Her hair looks so pretty in the sun. The way the breeze lifts her hair up without really blowing it looks really great.', '2006-02-02 15:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115048, 289188, 43753, '<td valign="top">Great silhiuette against a beautiful sky.</td>', 'Great silhiuette against a beautiful sky.', '2006-02-02 15:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115050, 289307, 43148, '<td valign="top">good dof nice color nice capture</td>', 'good dof nice color nice capture', '2006-02-02 15:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115052, 289211, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like the lighting and the tones a lot. Nice job on the exposure to get the fire and water blurred, and the silhouettes of the firefighters.</td>', 'Nice photo. I like the lighting and the tones a lot. Nice job on the exposure to get the fire and water blurred, and the silhouettes of the firefighters.', '2006-02-02 15:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115053, 288830, 43753, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at those details - AWESOME&gt; down to the stubble on the chin. Excellent, excellent, excellent.</td>', 'Wow, look at those details - AWESOME> down to the stubble on the chin. Excellent, excellent, excellent.', '2006-02-02 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115055, 286279, 31443, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and so simple, I like this alot..</td>', 'Beautiful light and so simple, I like this alot..', '2006-02-02 15:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115059, 289418, 43753, '<td valign="top">Excellent night shot with smooth lights, I love that touch of blue.</td>', 'Excellent night shot with smooth lights, I love that touch of blue.', '2006-02-02 15:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115061, 282986, 43753, '<td valign="top">Stunning. This is a great idea. What a little chunker. I just want to squeeze him or her. So, so beautiful.</td>', 'Stunning. This is a great idea. What a little chunker. I just want to squeeze him or her. So, so beautiful.', '2006-02-02 15:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
