(2115152, 288830, 13077, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The focus is excellent, and the lighting is also. I couldn''t help notice the spelling of the title, but I''m sure you''ll have plenty of other comments about that.. Great photo anyway, 9</td>', 'Great portrait. The focus is excellent, and the lighting is also. I couldn''t help notice the spelling of the title, but I''m sure you''ll have plenty of other comments about that.. Great photo anyway, 9', '2006-02-02 15:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115180, 289264, 8139, '<td valign="top">the quintessence of the winter tree. Very well done</td>', 'the quintessence of the winter tree. Very well done', '2006-02-02 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115187, 288078, 49942, '<td valign="top">very clear!Good subject</td>', 'very clear!Good subject', '2006-02-02 15:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115204, 289415, 8139, '<td valign="top">Dodging/burning should not be visible, ideally. Nice subject and props  though</td>', 'Dodging/burning should not be visible, ideally. Nice subject and props  though', '2006-02-02 16:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115216, 288595, 50056, '<td valign="top">interesting and appealing, I like the tones and composition, my only little critique is the shadow(?) on the R/S, it looks kinda like a burn tool error, though it probably isn''t.  I would really love to see this with the shadow dodged out, good luck.</td>', 'interesting and appealing, I like the tones and composition, my only little critique is the shadow(?) on the R/S, it looks kinda like a burn tool error, though it probably isn''t.  I would really love to see this with the shadow dodged out, good luck.', '2006-02-02 16:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115223, 280349, 50056, '<td valign="top">I love kid portraits in this setting although many people have remarked (to me, at least) that it is overdone.  I disagree.  I like the setting and composition here and I think it is a lovely portrait, I would have cropped out the R/S chain, though, in my opinion.  But good luck, a nice job here!</td>', 'I love kid portraits in this setting although many people have remarked (to me, at least) that it is overdone.  I disagree.  I like the setting and composition here and I think it is a lovely portrait, I would have cropped out the R/S chain, though, in my opinion.  But good luck, a nice job here!', '2006-02-02 16:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2115241, 286499, 50056, '<td valign="top">nice shot, I would love to see it with the entire BG desaturated and the FG in full color.  A good catch/composition, good luck</td>', 'nice shot, I would love to see it with the entire BG desaturated and the FG in full color.  A good catch/composition, good luck', '2006-02-02 16:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
