(2116234, 287134, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think it could be improved compositionally.  Particularly, I don''t think the reflection is necessary; I''d prefer to see the mask occupy more of the frame imho.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think it could be improved compositionally.  Particularly, I don''t think the reflection is necessary; I''d prefer to see the mask occupy more of the frame imho.', '2006-02-02 22:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
