(2116241, 286568, 509, '<td valign="top">Gotta be a good sign when sparks are flyin'' during the kiss ; )<br/>Nice capture, this might work well in black &amp; white too.</td>', 'Gotta be a good sign when sparks are flyin'' during the kiss ; )Nice capture, this might work well in black & white too.', '2006-02-02 22:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116248, 289343, 509, '<td valign="top">Looks a little oversharpened (noticeable on the rocks).  Without seeing the face/head of the animal, its kinda hard to have something to identify with in the shot.  The subject is the animal (seal?), but the texture of the shot is the rocks, which in my mind, attract more attention (contrary to what I''d perceive your intentions to be).  <br/> <br/>If you could try this shot again using a continuous shooting mode on your camera (if available), you''d have a better chance of getting the seal right before his head goes under, creating a better shot imho.</td>', 'Looks a little oversharpened (noticeable on the rocks).  Without seeing the face/head of the animal, its kinda hard to have something to identify with in the shot.  The subject is the animal (seal?), but the texture of the shot is the rocks, which in my mind, attract more attention (contrary to what I''d perceive your intentions to be).   If you could try this shot again using a continuous shooting mode on your camera (if available), you''d have a better chance of getting the seal right before his head goes under, creating a better shot imho.', '2006-02-02 22:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116252, 287715, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice work, the reflections in the valley are great.</td>', 'Nice work, the reflections in the valley are great.', '2006-02-02 22:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116254, 289163, 509, '<td valign="top">Strong composition (the 2 peaks spaced evenly in the frame, the space dedicated to the water reflections).  Good choice of black &amp; white too.</td>', 'Strong composition (the 2 peaks spaced evenly in the frame, the space dedicated to the water reflections).  Good choice of black & white too.', '2006-02-02 22:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116257, 289023, 509, '<td valign="top">Awesome reflection, looks very glassy.  I like the treatment given to the exposure as well, the contrast is strong but not overpowering.  Composition is good as well.  Excellent.</td>', 'Awesome reflection, looks very glassy.  I like the treatment given to the exposure as well, the contrast is strong but not overpowering.  Composition is good as well.  Excellent.', '2006-02-02 22:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116265, 282311, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  The scene looks relaxing and is pretty strong compositionally, though I might recommend cropping tighter on the sky (so that the horizon is not dead center).  This would also add emphasis to the water, where there is more detail to accentuate.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  The scene looks relaxing and is pretty strong compositionally, though I might recommend cropping tighter on the sky (so that the horizon is not dead center).  This would also add emphasis to the water, where there is more detail to accentuate.', '2006-02-02 22:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116321, 288624, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. I love the shapes of the stairs and the rails, and the tones look great.</td>', 'Excellent photo. I love the shapes of the stairs and the rails, and the tones look great.', '2006-02-02 22:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116336, 288988, 33947, '<td valign="top">Neat compositon amd perspective. Like the graphics look.</td>', 'Neat compositon amd perspective. Like the graphics look.', '2006-02-02 22:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116337, 280509, 772, '<td valign="top">absolutely fantastic...  love it :) 10 &amp; +fav</td>', 'absolutely fantastic...  love it :) 10 & +fav', '2006-02-02 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2116347, 289262, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the title!</td>', 'Love the title!', '2006-02-02 22:55:09.000000', NULL, 1);
