(2118486, 281630, 509, '<td valign="top">Great expression, only suggestions I have would be to clone that highlight on the top left so that it is uniform with the tan part of the background and to use a slightly smaller aperture to put her nose in stronger focus.</td>', 'Great expression, only suggestions I have would be to clone that highlight on the top left so that it is uniform with the tan part of the background and to use a slightly smaller aperture to put her nose in stronger focus.', '2006-02-03 13:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
