(2118631, 287056, 32767, '<td valign="top">That band looks as dull as toast. Semi menacing with a brickwall background...I think a dark alley shot would have worked better for these guys. Sorry if I sound mean but you hit a lot of cliches here...</td>', 'That band looks as dull as toast. Semi menacing with a brickwall background...I think a dark alley shot would have worked better for these guys. Sorry if I sound mean but you hit a lot of cliches here...', '2006-02-03 14:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
