(2118708, 286670, 43753, '<td valign="top">The yellow hats really break up an otherwise drab color scheme. This makes the image in my opinion - excellent. I like the DOF you use too.</td>', 'The yellow hats really break up an otherwise drab color scheme. This makes the image in my opinion - excellent. I like the DOF you use too.', '2006-02-03 14:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
