(2118758, 289415, 43753, '<td valign="top">ilike the treatment you have given to this image. I don''t know how I feel about the lighting. There seems to be something odd about the lighting right in the center. It doesn''t match the other lighting. I really like the selective coloring on the flower and his look is just adorable. Nice shot!.</td>', 'ilike the treatment you have given to this image. I don''t know how I feel about the lighting. There seems to be something odd about the lighting right in the center. It doesn''t match the other lighting. I really like the selective coloring on the flower and his look is just adorable. Nice shot!.', '2006-02-03 14:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2118760, 288087, 43753, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract. I love hte colors and the curves. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract. I love hte colors and the curves. Well done.', '2006-02-03 14:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2118781, 287280, 43434, '<td valign="top">Very centred shot.</td>', 'Very centred shot.', '2006-02-03 15:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
