(2119411, 280293, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is beautiful!  I love the muted look, and how you can see the birds sitting on the posts.  Amazing focus!!</td>', 'That is beautiful!  I love the muted look, and how you can see the birds sitting on the posts.  Amazing focus!!', '2006-02-03 18:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
