(2119417, 284889, 40679, '<td valign="top">awww.. if you''d place your photo with 640 px wide I think this would''ve score pretty high. right now you''ll probably get low scores because it''s too small. not from me, I like it, especially the eye!</td>', 'awww.. if you''d place your photo with 640 px wide I think this would''ve score pretty high. right now you''ll probably get low scores because it''s too small. not from me, I like it, especially the eye!', '2006-02-03 18:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119422, 287414, 40019, '<td valign="top">I love the matching paint and eye colors, great use of background.  The wind swept hair look is always cool as well!  Only thing I would have liked is a little tighter crop on the face to better play out the eye/background match. No points off for that, just my opinion.  Great shot!</td>', 'I love the matching paint and eye colors, great use of background.  The wind swept hair look is always cool as well!  Only thing I would have liked is a little tighter crop on the face to better play out the eye/background match. No points off for that, just my opinion.  Great shot!', '2006-02-03 18:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119432, 286790, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very nice image - quite striking!  Textures and saturation are great!</td>', 'Very nice image - quite striking!  Textures and saturation are great!', '2006-02-03 18:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119436, 288586, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Great lighting.  Very nice post processing job!  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice composition.  Great lighting.  Very nice post processing job!  Good luck!', '2006-02-03 18:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119441, 284820, 9452, '<td valign="top">Strong image! It really says a sad story. Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'Strong image! It really says a sad story. Thanks for sharing!', '2006-02-03 18:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119448, 284875, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture!  Looks like a poster!  I''ll have to go check out this lighthouse.  Nicely done - good post processing.</td>', 'Very nice picture!  Looks like a poster!  I''ll have to go check out this lighthouse.  Nicely done - good post processing.', '2006-02-03 18:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119450, 286769, 40679, '<td valign="top">very surprising crop you''ve got here. I like it!</td>', 'very surprising crop you''ve got here. I like it!', '2006-02-03 18:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119455, 288851, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Love the water flow and different textures - great exposure.  Very nice picture, but also pretty common.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice image. Love the water flow and different textures - great exposure.  Very nice picture, but also pretty common.  Good luck!', '2006-02-03 18:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119456, 286141, 41522, '<td valign="top">What wonderful colourings on this bird.  Nice feather details.  Good compositional layout and bokeh.</td>', 'What wonderful colourings on this bird.  Nice feather details.  Good compositional layout and bokeh.', '2006-02-03 18:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119463, 276743, 41522, '<td valign="top">Good advertising shot.  I like the DOF.</td>', 'Good advertising shot.  I like the DOF.', '2006-02-03 18:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119464, 288259, 40679, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what Dionysus did, but I really like the abstract feel of this. the B&amp;W really work with the burst of red :)</td>', 'I don''t know what Dionysus did, but I really like the abstract feel of this. the B&W really work with the burst of red :)', '2006-02-03 18:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119471, 288204, 9452, '<td valign="top">The best so far! 10.</td>', 'The best so far! 10.', '2006-02-03 18:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119472, 288153, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice macro! Great colors!  Not sure how much room you had pre-crop, but I would have cropped out more of the left hand side and played the butterfuly off the darker green and purple backgrounds.  The middle-lower-leaf is a little overexposed and very distracting.  The background greens also seem a little processed, but still play nicely against the colors of the butterfly.  I just don''t like that leaf on the bottom.  DOF is spot on! Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice macro! Great colors!  Not sure how much room you had pre-crop, but I would have cropped out more of the left hand side and played the butterfuly off the darker green and purple backgrounds.  The middle-lower-leaf is a little overexposed and very distracting.  The background greens also seem a little processed, but still play nicely against the colors of the butterfly.  I just don''t like that leaf on the bottom.  DOF is spot on! Nice shot.', '2006-02-03 18:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119476, 277512, 9452, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, nothing more to say.</td>', 'Excellent capture, nothing more to say.', '2006-02-03 18:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119477, 283578, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice clean image - wonderful colors, great reflection, good details.  Great job! Good luck!</td>', 'This is a very nice clean image - wonderful colors, great reflection, good details.  Great job! Good luck!', '2006-02-03 18:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119479, 282151, 41522, '<td valign="top">The strong white lines seem to me to be over sharpening.  If I''m wrong on this, please forgive me.</td>', 'The strong white lines seem to me to be over sharpening.  If I''m wrong on this, please forgive me.', '2006-02-03 18:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119481, 288450, 40679, '<td valign="top">very very nice. great lighting, props ( ;) ) and pose. congrats to you and your model!</td>', 'very very nice. great lighting, props ( ;) ) and pose. congrats to you and your model!', '2006-02-03 18:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119483, 283216, 9452, '<td valign="top">Great capture! Beside the big lense you used, I wonder how you did it.</td>', 'Great capture! Beside the big lense you used, I wonder how you did it.', '2006-02-03 18:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119486, 289410, 40019, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro!  I really like the way you cropped in to fill the image with color.  Very simple and elegant, nicely done.  I also like how you appreciated the powerfulness of the colors and didn''t kill it with a border - good decision.  The lighting really made this shot for you, nice job.</td>', 'Wonderful macro!  I really like the way you cropped in to fill the image with color.  Very simple and elegant, nicely done.  I also like how you appreciated the powerfulness of the colors and didn''t kill it with a border - good decision.  The lighting really made this shot for you, nice job.', '2006-02-03 18:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119487, 288705, 40667, '<td valign="top">Amazing! great contrast, and the noise works very well here! Nice job!</td>', 'Amazing! great contrast, and the noise works very well here! Nice job!', '2006-02-03 18:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119488, 289208, 51553, '<td valign="top">I would almost blur that bit of eyebrow that is in focus as it lures the lookers eye away from the eye in the picture.</td>', 'I would almost blur that bit of eyebrow that is in focus as it lures the lookers eye away from the eye in the picture.', '2006-02-03 18:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119489, 281561, 40019, '<td valign="top">Interesting twist on an overdone concept.  Nice stop action - very clean!  Good luck!</td>', 'Interesting twist on an overdone concept.  Nice stop action - very clean!  Good luck!', '2006-02-03 18:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119493, 289355, 40679, '<td valign="top">nice high key image you have here!</td>', 'nice high key image you have here!', '2006-02-03 18:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119496, 276743, 40019, '<td valign="top">You''re obviously in the advertising business!  If not, you should be - great studio shot!  Definite magazine material.  Nicely done.</td>', 'You''re obviously in the advertising business!  If not, you should be - great studio shot!  Definite magazine material.  Nicely done.', '2006-02-03 18:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119502, 277998, 42013, '<td valign="top">great job on this pic.  Although I like black backgrounds, i think just a touch of light on the BG might have strengthened the pic.  JMO and still an 8 from me.</td>', 'great job on this pic.  Although I like black backgrounds, i think just a touch of light on the BG might have strengthened the pic.  JMO and still an 8 from me.', '2006-02-03 18:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119503, 279947, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cool image!  The post-processing is quite evident and starts taking the picture in the direction of digital artwork.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Cool image!  The post-processing is quite evident and starts taking the picture in the direction of digital artwork.  Very nicely done.', '2006-02-03 18:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119505, 284241, 41522, '<td valign="top">I really like the look of the water and the tones of the sky.  I''m not really keen on the tilted vew of this.  For me, no matter what the effect is on water, I like water to be level.  Just a personal preference.</td>', 'I really like the look of the water and the tones of the sky.  I''m not really keen on the tilted vew of this.  For me, no matter what the effect is on water, I like water to be level.  Just a personal preference.', '2006-02-03 18:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119517, 288671, 9452, '<td valign="top">Breathless!</td>', 'Breathless!', '2006-02-03 18:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119523, 278189, 40019, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice picture and the contrasting colors were captured very well - nice job!  I''m not sure the subject material will get you a very high score though.  I think putting a border around the image (to make it look more like a framed picture on a wall) would have helped this image more.  Right now, it comes across as just a very nice snapshot.  I do like the colors though, very cool.</td>', 'This is a very nice picture and the contrasting colors were captured very well - nice job!  I''m not sure the subject material will get you a very high score though.  I think putting a border around the image (to make it look more like a framed picture on a wall) would have helped this image more.  Right now, it comes across as just a very nice snapshot.  I do like the colors though, very cool.', '2006-02-03 18:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119527, 288258, 51553, '<td valign="top">I like your use of open space.</td>', 'I like your use of open space.', '2006-02-03 18:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119528, 284108, 40019, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, colors and DOF.  Not sure what''s going on with the white vignetting - it really detracts from the image (IMO).</td>', 'I like the composition, colors and DOF.  Not sure what''s going on with the white vignetting - it really detracts from the image (IMO).', '2006-02-03 18:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
