(2119888, 287024, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - This shot opens itself up to a variety of interpretations on what this is about/story it tells, in my opinion.  Good and unusual capture.  The gold, especially the candleholders in the background, add a good element.  Criticism; not much, perhaps emphasizing that ''gold'' (including the cross) ''somehow'', a little sharper as well, not sure about the reflection on the temple/head, because that could add to ''stories'' too.  Perhaps a more refined cropping and as just mentioned, trying to gain a fraction more ''depth'' and ''drama'' overall in this shot, may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - This shot opens itself up to a variety of interpretations on what this is about/story it tells, in my opinion.  Good and unusual capture.  The gold, especially the candleholders in the background, add a good element.  Criticism; not much, perhaps emphasizing that ''gold'' (including the cross) ''somehow'', a little sharper as well, not sure about the reflection on the temple/head, because that could add to ''stories'' too.  Perhaps a more refined cropping and as just mentioned, trying to gain a fraction more ''depth'' and ''drama'' overall in this shot, may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2006-02-03 20:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119897, 286769, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice capture, silhouette(s) composition and choice of vertical framing.  Criticism; apart from the crooked horizon, perhaps a fraction wider, especially for ''here'', may have given this just a little more in my opinion, but not sure as, works well as is.</td>', '6 - Nice capture, silhouette(s) composition and choice of vertical framing.  Criticism; apart from the crooked horizon, perhaps a fraction wider, especially for ''here'', may have given this just a little more in my opinion, but not sure as, works well as is.', '2006-02-03 20:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119907, 288705, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture.  The grain and toning work well here in my opinion.  Criticism; difficult, maybe a fraction more space (if you had it, obviously) under the tail, the shirt folds detract, but fairly minor, maybe a slight softening/blurring of the background to help the ''trusting one'' pop a little more, not sure.</td>', '7 - Nice capture.  The grain and toning work well here in my opinion.  Criticism; difficult, maybe a fraction more space (if you had it, obviously) under the tail, the shirt folds detract, but fairly minor, maybe a slight softening/blurring of the background to help the ''trusting one'' pop a little more, not sure.', '2006-02-03 20:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119910, 288574, 42013, '<td valign="top">just a little overexposure on the beak.</td>', 'just a little overexposure on the beak.', '2006-02-03 20:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
