(2119932, 282151, 14476, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it fascinating to look at what is within a flower.  Nice little fairyland scene.  If you used a tripod, maybe a bit more experimentation with depth of field would be fun to do.</td>', 'Isn''t it fascinating to look at what is within a flower.  Nice little fairyland scene.  If you used a tripod, maybe a bit more experimentation with depth of field would be fun to do.', '2006-02-03 20:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2119937, 288613, 14476, '<td valign="top">Sapporo, eh?  Reminds me of the old days whdn I lived in Upstate New York!  Whatever, the lighting on this tells me you have learned the lessons of white balance well, and the composition isn''t so bad either!<br/>;&gt;)</td>', 'Sapporo, eh?  Reminds me of the old days whdn I lived in Upstate New York!  Whatever, the lighting on this tells me you have learned the lessons of white balance well, and the composition isn''t so bad either!;>)', '2006-02-03 20:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
