(2119999, 287232, 42456, '<td valign="top">I like the concept with the color here; however, I would normally mark down for the halo along the rim and the distracting black holes in the image. I would like to see a bit more detail. It is interesting that the end of the canyon wall where it seems to be its darkest is a contrasting bright spot and again this keeps pulling away from the rest of such a beautiful image. I am curious though...did you use RSE? I like the original thinging with the border. I also like your original thinking with color choices. I love color and despite every...I''m giving it a 10!</td>', 'I like the concept with the color here; however, I would normally mark down for the halo along the rim and the distracting black holes in the image. I would like to see a bit more detail. It is interesting that the end of the canyon wall where it seems to be its darkest is a contrasting bright spot and again this keeps pulling away from the rest of such a beautiful image. I am curious though...did you use RSE? I like the original thinging with the border. I also like your original thinking with color choices. I love color and despite every...I''m giving it a 10!', '2006-02-03 21:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
