(2120028, 280281, 38032, '<td valign="top">this is tough to judge - on  one hand it is an excellent pic of the moon - far better than i have ever achieved.  on the other, I have seen the moon in pictures many many times and there is nothing about this that makes it exceptional other than the fact that it looks great.  The sky is perfectly black and the moon is detailed and mysterious.  Gonna go 7.  Very nice work - I do like the subtle edges of the moon at the bottom and the execution is excellent.  Of course, if this is something other than the earth''s moon than I would have bumped it up a point :) ... LIke say this is Jupiter''s moon ... quite a telescope lens you have!</td>', 'this is tough to judge - on  one hand it is an excellent pic of the moon - far better than i have ever achieved.  on the other, I have seen the moon in pictures many many times and there is nothing about this that makes it exceptional other than the fact that it looks great.  The sky is perfectly black and the moon is detailed and mysterious.  Gonna go 7.  Very nice work - I do like the subtle edges of the moon at the bottom and the execution is excellent.  Of course, if this is something other than the earth''s moon than I would have bumped it up a point :) ... LIke say this is Jupiter''s moon ... quite a telescope lens you have!', '2006-02-03 21:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120033, 288255, 38032, '<td valign="top">provocative  -this is really mysterious in a way.</td>', 'provocative  -this is really mysterious in a way.', '2006-02-03 21:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
