(2120090, 287550, 38032, '<td valign="top">there is something about these guys that I really like.  The way they are distant from your shot (they aren''t aware, it seems) is very sincere.  The compostion and simplicit is also very appealing.  9</td>', 'there is something about these guys that I really like.  The way they are distant from your shot (they aren''t aware, it seems) is very sincere.  The compostion and simplicit is also very appealing.  9', '2006-02-03 21:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
