(2120107, 288493, 38032, '<td valign="top">the snow here really adds to the blanched, high contrast feel here - the foggy distance makes it just amazing ... I like the way the contrast makes me want no more contrast.  yeah that''s right!</td>', 'the snow here really adds to the blanched, high contrast feel here - the foggy distance makes it just amazing ... I like the way the contrast makes me want no more contrast.  yeah that''s right!', '2006-02-03 21:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120124, 283578, 7485, '<td valign="top">One word: crystaline! Beautifully done.</td>', 'One word: crystaline! Beautifully done.', '2006-02-03 21:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120126, 276288, 38032, '<td valign="top">I love the title ... no wait .. i love the photo.  Great sign.</td>', 'I love the title ... no wait .. i love the photo.  Great sign.', '2006-02-03 21:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120129, 286283, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, great pinkish color. If it wasn''t for that cattle fence, It would almost guess it was another planet. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting picture, great pinkish color. If it wasn''t for that cattle fence, It would almost guess it was another planet. Well done.', '2006-02-03 21:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120130, 288637, 38032, '<td valign="top">There is an effect here that I cannot put my finger on ... great image, great POV, great dog.</td>', 'There is an effect here that I cannot put my finger on ... great image, great POV, great dog.', '2006-02-03 21:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120132, 289038, 39106, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.</td>', 'Very nice image.', '2006-02-03 21:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120136, 288619, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, crisp and clear. I like the line of the ridge on the left and the reflection, really draws you to the softer curve of the other range. Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful color, crisp and clear. I like the line of the ridge on the left and the reflection, really draws you to the softer curve of the other range. Very nice.', '2006-02-03 21:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120137, 280772, 38032, '<td valign="top">unique and a great illusion  -</td>', 'unique and a great illusion  -', '2006-02-03 21:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120139, 288880, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful clear and vivid sky. Love the sharpness of it. The foreground is a bit distracting and I believe the hay stack there really takes away from the picture.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful clear and vivid sky. Love the sharpness of it. The foreground is a bit distracting and I believe the hay stack there really takes away from the picture.', '2006-02-03 21:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120143, 277604, 38032, '<td valign="top">odd - in a 7 kinda way</td>', 'odd - in a 7 kinda way', '2006-02-03 21:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120145, 281550, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture, Great tree and the transition of the cloud. Good use of space. The glow is pretty unique on the tree. Well done!</td>', 'Very interesting picture, Great tree and the transition of the cloud. Good use of space. The glow is pretty unique on the tree. Well done!', '2006-02-03 21:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120148, 288652, 11738, '<td valign="top">This could have used a bit more colour saturation to give it more punch.  Some orange or orange/yellow would have been nice.</td>', 'This could have used a bit more colour saturation to give it more punch.  Some orange or orange/yellow would have been nice.', '2006-02-03 21:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120151, 283476, 42638, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, looks like a catalog shoot. The way she is looking off to the side is classic.</td>', 'Beautiful, looks like a catalog shoot. The way she is looking off to the side is classic.', '2006-02-03 21:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120159, 286141, 6667, '<td valign="top">Simply spectacular! Nice capture BOL 8 here</td>', 'Simply spectacular! Nice capture BOL 8 here', '2006-02-03 21:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120183, 289013, 30608, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite pictures in the whole challenge. Incredible focus and superb lighting in this photograph. Very well done! 10</td>', 'This is one of my favorite pictures in the whole challenge. Incredible focus and superb lighting in this photograph. Very well done! 10', '2006-02-03 22:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120185, 284619, 30608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and DOF. Focus is perfect. Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful composition and DOF. Focus is perfect. Good luck!', '2006-02-03 22:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120197, 286775, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - Difficult to discern the potential in this.  Criticism; needs to be bigger (640 width in this case), looks also like pixelation issues.  There are PS tutorials for resizing under the DPC Help menu otherwise experiment with your software to try to perfect this.</td>', '2 - Difficult to discern the potential in this.  Criticism; needs to be bigger (640 width in this case), looks also like pixelation issues.  There are PS tutorials for resizing under the DPC Help menu otherwise experiment with your software to try to perfect this.', '2006-02-03 22:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120208, 287432, 39850, '<td valign="top">2 - For a shot like this to work, it has to have something interesting behind it, be it a pattern, shape or object, etc in my opinion.  Also, either perfect symmetry or ''offset'' of the blinds would have helped this.  The lighting coming through also dominates this in my opinion.</td>', '2 - For a shot like this to work, it has to have something interesting behind it, be it a pattern, shape or object, etc in my opinion.  Also, either perfect symmetry or ''offset'' of the blinds would have helped this.  The lighting coming through also dominates this in my opinion.', '2006-02-03 22:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120216, 286515, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Wow, good close up and perspective.  The bird looks huge.  Criticism; difficult with the ''opportunity shot'', but just a bit more detail in the feathers, perhaps just a ''fraction'' more zoom out, just seems a bit too close focus wise, but hard to discern and if the ''blown'' parts were ''fixed'', make this even better in my opinion.  Maybe also a selective desaturation to ''enhance'' the illusion of the bird, somehow, not sure.</td>', '7 - Wow, good close up and perspective.  The bird looks huge.  Criticism; difficult with the ''opportunity shot'', but just a bit more detail in the feathers, perhaps just a ''fraction'' more zoom out, just seems a bit too close focus wise, but hard to discern and if the ''blown'' parts were ''fixed'', make this even better in my opinion.  Maybe also a selective desaturation to ''enhance'' the illusion of the bird, somehow, not sure.', '2006-02-03 22:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120221, 289381, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Your call obviously on the b&amp;w/toning, works well, especially with the feather patterns.  Criticism; difficult due to the processing and grain involved, just like to see the eyes a bit sharper/dominant.</td>', '6 - Your call obviously on the b&w/toning, works well, especially with the feather patterns.  Criticism; difficult due to the processing and grain involved, just like to see the eyes a bit sharper/dominant.', '2006-02-03 22:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120224, 282536, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Looks like good potential.  Criticism; needs to be bigger (640 width in this case).  Difficult to discern the clarity and sharpness focal wise, but looks like it <i>may</i> need to be sharper.  Compositionally, I think if this were more off-centered, or even a vertical framing perhaps, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - Looks like good potential.  Criticism; needs to be bigger (640 width in this case).  Difficult to discern the clarity and sharpness focal wise, but looks like it may need to be sharper.  Compositionally, I think if this were more off-centered, or even a vertical framing perhaps, make this better in my opinion.', '2006-02-03 22:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120225, 289028, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Looks like good potential.  Criticism; horizon seems crooked.  A little more detail in the fore rocks and reflections if possible, would have also made this better in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Looks like good potential.  Criticism; horizon seems crooked.  A little more detail in the fore rocks and reflections if possible, would have also made this better in my opinion.', '2006-02-03 22:23:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2120232, 288616, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice capture, composition and colors.  Like the leaf perspective.  Criticism; difficult but.. sharper.  Perhaps also, depending what you had to work with, a tighter crop on the left to center the subject and leaf more may have also made this even better, not sure.</td>', '6 - Nice capture, composition and colors.  Like the leaf perspective.  Criticism; difficult but.. sharper.  Perhaps also, depending what you had to work with, a tighter crop on the left to center the subject and leaf more may have also made this even better, not sure.', '2006-02-03 22:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120241, 286141, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow - great colors and excellent sharp focus. Nicely done!</td>', 'Wow - great colors and excellent sharp focus. Nicely done!', '2006-02-03 22:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120243, 285663, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Criticism; the apartments/chalets/whatever detract in my opinion from the overall feel of this shot, including their color.  Perhaps this with toning or b&amp;w may have been better not sure.  I think this even cropped, still using this good sharp perspective (even sharper be better), trying to get a fraction more detail in the water/creek/ice/snow, and cropped at the bend of the creek/just before the ''railing''/fence, may have made this even better in my opinion, although obviously - a quite different shot.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Criticism; the apartments/chalets/whatever detract in my opinion from the overall feel of this shot, including their color.  Perhaps this with toning or b&w may have been better not sure.  I think this even cropped, still using this good sharp perspective (even sharper be better), trying to get a fraction more detail in the water/creek/ice/snow, and cropped at the bend of the creek/just before the ''railing''/fence, may have made this even better in my opinion, although obviously - a quite different shot.', '2006-02-03 22:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120244, 281051, 42826, '<td valign="top">I think had some of the space on the top been cropped and the sides have been cropped even tighter it would have been more impacting...but again, that is only my opinion!  I love the black and white...</td>', 'I think had some of the space on the top been cropped and the sides have been cropped even tighter it would have been more impacting...but again, that is only my opinion!  I love the black and white...', '2006-02-03 22:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120249, 286272, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is quite interesting.  It looks like a night shot to me with the dark clouds, but unless the turbines were all off I don''t think it was.<br/> <br/>Overall there are a few problems although I think you had a good idea.  Overall processing seems a bit rough.  There are spots on the right edge which look like burn marks.  I''m not sure what that is.  This color sky is not my favorite.  Maybe it''s personal preference, but I don''t like light cyan as a sky color.  The dark clouds are really interesting, but I wish they were a little sharper.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing you were hampered in where you could stand to take the picture.  Otherwise I would have walked closer to the turbines so they would have commanded more of the frame.<br/> <br/>To sumarize, an interesting idea, especially if it is a night shot.  The technical problems with the sky probably are the biggest limiting factor here.</td>', 'This is quite interesting.  It looks like a night shot to me with the dark clouds, but unless the turbines were all off I don''t think it was. Overall there are a few problems although I think you had a good idea.  Overall processing seems a bit rough.  There are spots on the right edge which look like burn marks.  I''m not sure what that is.  This color sky is not my favorite.  Maybe it''s personal preference, but I don''t like light cyan as a sky color.  The dark clouds are really interesting, but I wish they were a little sharper. I''m guessing you were hampered in where you could stand to take the picture.  Otherwise I would have walked closer to the turbines so they would have commanded more of the frame. To sumarize, an interesting idea, especially if it is a night shot.  The technical problems with the sky probably are the biggest limiting factor here.', '2006-02-03 22:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120261, 287072, 42005, '<td valign="top">Totally 10</td>', 'Totally 10', '2006-02-03 22:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120265, 287868, 27164, '<td valign="top">Great use of color - beautiful photograph.  The lighting is great as well.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great use of color - beautiful photograph.  The lighting is great as well.  Good luck!', '2006-02-03 22:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120269, 282601, 41522, '<td valign="top">Very cool persepective.  I really wish that the bear''s shoulder and foot had not been clipped off.  JMO.</td>', 'Very cool persepective.  I really wish that the bear''s shoulder and foot had not been clipped off.  JMO.', '2006-02-03 22:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120276, 288830, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice portrait/character capture.  Toning works well.  Criticism; not much, perhaps either cropping even tighter at the top to eliminate that hair upper right, but minor and changes the face/expression slightly so not sure.  Typo in your title, unless it is deliberate.</td>', '7 - Nice portrait/character capture.  Toning works well.  Criticism; not much, perhaps either cropping even tighter at the top to eliminate that hair upper right, but minor and changes the face/expression slightly so not sure.  Typo in your title, unless it is deliberate.', '2006-02-03 22:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120279, 280509, 18191, '<td valign="top">Great... I think I know who this may be...<br/> <br/>Love it -- one of my favs of the challenge for sure.</td>', 'Great... I think I know who this may be... Love it -- one of my favs of the challenge for sure.', '2006-02-03 22:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120281, 284493, 27164, '<td valign="top">Great lighting - this is simply beautiful.  Top ten for sure...</td>', 'Great lighting - this is simply beautiful.  Top ten for sure...', '2006-02-03 22:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120283, 279282, 27164, '<td valign="top">Nice sunstar effect!  Very appealing.</td>', 'Nice sunstar effect!  Very appealing.', '2006-02-03 22:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120285, 287619, 27164, '<td valign="top">Great use of color.  Beautiful landscape with great lighting.</td>', 'Great use of color.  Beautiful landscape with great lighting.', '2006-02-03 22:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120286, 288742, 41522, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model and technically wonderful shot and processing.  Good crisp lines on the eye.  I''m really having a problem wih the orange line in the foreground.  It''s posiion and strength is overwhelming my eye and acting as a magnet, pulling attention away from your model.  JMO.</td>', 'A beautiful model and technically wonderful shot and processing.  Good crisp lines on the eye.  I''m really having a problem wih the orange line in the foreground.  It''s posiion and strength is overwhelming my eye and acting as a magnet, pulling attention away from your model.  JMO.', '2006-02-03 22:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120293, 288561, 18191, '<td valign="top">Hrmm... looks like you flipped this one horizontally .. either that or you''ve got some weird trombone!<br/> <br/>Givin'' u some extra loving bonus points from a trombonist!</td>', 'Hrmm... looks like you flipped this one horizontally .. either that or you''ve got some weird trombone! Givin'' u some extra loving bonus points from a trombonist!', '2006-02-03 22:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120294, 289188, 41522, '<td valign="top">Technically, the exposure is without fault.  The silhouette is nice an sharp.  I can''t help but wonder hat the wider view might have shown us.  The sky, what I can see of it, seems very nice and the colours look great.  I think I would have liked to have seen more of it.  JMO.</td>', 'Technically, the exposure is without fault.  The silhouette is nice an sharp.  I can''t help but wonder hat the wider view might have shown us.  The sky, what I can see of it, seems very nice and the colours look great.  I think I would have liked to have seen more of it.  JMO.', '2006-02-03 22:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120296, 279727, 18191, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mood!</td>', 'Beautiful mood!', '2006-02-03 22:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120310, 289410, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  Nice color(s).  Criticism; difficult, as the best focus is on the leaves/straps, which looks intentional, but perhaps if just a fraction more detail in either the middle or right flowers/color may have made this even better in my opinion.  Maybe some more light ''play'' incorporated.  More finely tuned cropping bottom left corner too.</td>', '7 - Nice.  Nice color(s).  Criticism; difficult, as the best focus is on the leaves/straps, which looks intentional, but perhaps if just a fraction more detail in either the middle or right flowers/color may have made this even better in my opinion.  Maybe some more light ''play'' incorporated.  More finely tuned cropping bottom left corner too.', '2006-02-03 23:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120335, 279777, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture.  Criticism; mainly the bottom and left crop/''cutting''.  Perhaps a fraction more centered too, not sure.  Nice contrasting ''warm feel'' to this, especially in her hair, compared to the seemingly gray sky/clouds above - if ''that'' could be emphasized ''somehow'' may have given this just a little extra in my opinion.  edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 06:10:11.</i></td>', '7 - Nice capture.  Criticism; mainly the bottom and left crop/''cutting''.  Perhaps a fraction more centered too, not sure.  Nice contrasting ''warm feel'' to this, especially in her hair, compared to the seemingly gray sky/clouds above - if ''that'' could be emphasized ''somehow'' may have given this just a little extra in my opinion.  edit:typo', '2006-02-03 23:11:24.000000', '2006-02-08 06:10:11.000000', 1),
(2120358, 281051, 13077, '<td valign="top">I love the tones in this, great photo. Nice job getting the focus to include all three of them but still have a nice out-of-focus background.</td>', 'I love the tones in this, great photo. Nice job getting the focus to include all three of them but still have a nice out-of-focus background.', '2006-02-03 23:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
