(2120765, 285894, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good focus on the eyes with a touch of softness and shallow dof. The colors are great. I would have cropped the left and top so that the blurred red/orange thingy gets removed. A tight crop of the face would still have impact as the eyes are very powerful. Great job. 7</td>', 'Very nice. Good focus on the eyes with a touch of softness and shallow dof. The colors are great. I would have cropped the left and top so that the blurred red/orange thingy gets removed. A tight crop of the face would still have impact as the eyes are very powerful. Great job. 7', '2006-02-04 04:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
