(2120901, 282756, 43753, '<td valign="top">I really love this composition. The only thing I think could be improved upon is the coloring. When I look at it, there is almost a light hazy sheen, but the entire image isn''t washed out, because the red in the clouds is very vibrant. If you have Photoshop (or some similar editing program), I would try adjusting curves and reduce the noise. I think darks will be crisper, and all the colors in the sky more vibrant. The composition itself is just wonderful.</td>', 'I really love this composition. The only thing I think could be improved upon is the coloring. When I look at it, there is almost a light hazy sheen, but the entire image isn''t washed out, because the red in the clouds is very vibrant. If you have Photoshop (or some similar editing program), I would try adjusting curves and reduce the noise. I think darks will be crisper, and all the colors in the sky more vibrant. The composition itself is just wonderful.', '2006-02-04 07:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120903, 277972, 43753, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. I can''t say enough about the colors in this image. There is very little else besides the bird too, whoch helps. The branches and leaves are very uniform throughout the image which helps train the ee on the bird. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful capture. I can''t say enough about the colors in this image. There is very little else besides the bird too, whoch helps. The branches and leaves are very uniform throughout the image which helps train the ee on the bird. Well done.', '2006-02-04 07:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120905, 288453, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice natural portrait. The colors are nice, but it is a little to light in the skin. Maybe a notch down on exposure and some noise reduction could really clean things up and bring in more detail in the tones and colors.</td>', 'Nice natural portrait. The colors are nice, but it is a little to light in the skin. Maybe a notch down on exposure and some noise reduction could really clean things up and bring in more detail in the tones and colors.', '2006-02-04 07:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120907, 287072, 43753, '<td valign="top">I can''t say enough about this image. Very beautiful and simple. I love the smooth white hill of snow and the crisp slender details of the grass. Well done!!</td>', 'I can''t say enough about this image. Very beautiful and simple. I love the smooth white hill of snow and the crisp slender details of the grass. Well done!!', '2006-02-04 07:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
