(2121106, 289012, 43753, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of wildlife. The brown color is a little heavy. Maybe a conversion to B&amp;W, so teh eyes can focus more on the textures and contrast ratehr than the brown color.</td>', 'Nice shot of wildlife. The brown color is a little heavy. Maybe a conversion to B&W, so teh eyes can focus more on the textures and contrast ratehr than the brown color.', '2006-02-04 09:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121112, 283068, 43753, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro. I love the lighting, and the colors. Great work!</td>', 'Excellent macro. I love the lighting, and the colors. Great work!', '2006-02-04 09:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121115, 281401, 40819, '<td valign="top">I am secure enough in my manhood to say this is an excellent shot in so many ways. I would have to say even sexy. The black and white takes me to a more innocent time though there is nothing innocent about this image. He is there and he is turning heads. It is like he is saying Im not the hottest guy in the world; Im just a man a real man, all man. I believe anyone who ignores this does so at their loss. <br/> <br/>Excellent photograph cant call it a picture, men are men and women are women this guy is the man.<br/> <br/>Michael</td>', 'I am secure enough in my manhood to say this is an excellent shot in so many ways. I would have to say even sexy. The black and white takes me to a more innocent time though there is nothing innocent about this image. He is there and he is turning heads. It is like he is saying Im not the hottest guy in the world; Im just a man a real man, all man. I believe anyone who ignores this does so at their loss.  Excellent photograph cant call it a picture, men are men and women are women this guy is the man. Michael', '2006-02-04 09:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121116, 287069, 43753, '<td valign="top">What an awesome shot. I love the sky and the crosses there in the lower right corner. Simply beautiful.</td>', 'What an awesome shot. I love the sky and the crosses there in the lower right corner. Simply beautiful.', '2006-02-04 09:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121120, 279901, 43753, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here, but the composition as a whole lacks imapact. If you move further away, we might see more details to give context to her existance, like bags or a sign or something. If you move closer, maybe we can see more details in her face. As it stands, there isn''t really anything the viewer can engage in.</td>', 'I like the colors here, but the composition as a whole lacks imapact. If you move further away, we might see more details to give context to her existance, like bags or a sign or something. If you move closer, maybe we can see more details in her face. As it stands, there isn''t really anything the viewer can engage in.', '2006-02-04 09:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121122, 284132, 42918, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing picture, the visible "noise" really works well in this photo and gives it incredible character.</td>', 'This is an amazing picture, the visible "noise" really works well in this photo and gives it incredible character.', '2006-02-04 09:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121132, 289275, 43753, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity in the reflection. I think the image would have more impact if more details could be seen on te front of the little birdhouse. You can see some detail in the reflection, but the eyes have to travel too far either side of the frame to see the details.</td>', 'Excellent clarity in the reflection. I think the image would have more impact if more details could be seen on te front of the little birdhouse. You can see some detail in the reflection, but the eyes have to travel too far either side of the frame to see the details.', '2006-02-04 09:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
