(2121397, 287069, 7485, '<td valign="top">My initial reaction was "Not another sunset!", immediatly followed by "Hold on, this one is actually really good!" Getting beautiful color out of a sunset is trivial, but creating such an excellent composition is a sure sign of real skill.</td>', 'My initial reaction was "Not another sunset!", immediatly followed by "Hold on, this one is actually really good!" Getting beautiful color out of a sunset is trivial, but creating such an excellent composition is a sure sign of real skill.', '2006-02-04 12:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121411, 288957, 43434, '<td valign="top">Wow ... this is one weird shot - I like the fact that it is lost in the whiteness .... but has it been overprocessed to have lost its shape as well ... this  one will be interesting to re-visit and look at what effect you were after (from the photographes comments)... but all in all this is what i would call really quite funky!  Two things ... This may have benefited from hitting vertical and horizontal thirds on the top left side ... as you have you hit vertical and still give the bird somewhere to fly ... but hitting the horizontal may have added something ... second ... the size/resizing of the picture is on the slightly small size.  We can enter up to 640 on the long side .. aim for this for when voting people want the biggest impact to score the best ... :)<br/> <br/>Kari</td>', 'Wow ... this is one weird shot - I like the fact that it is lost in the whiteness .... but has it been overprocessed to have lost its shape as well ... this  one will be interesting to re-visit and look at what effect you were after (from the photographes comments)... but all in all this is what i would call really quite funky!  Two things ... This may have benefited from hitting vertical and horizontal thirds on the top left side ... as you have you hit vertical and still give the bird somewhere to fly ... but hitting the horizontal may have added something ... second ... the size/resizing of the picture is on the slightly small size.  We can enter up to 640 on the long side .. aim for this for when voting people want the biggest impact to score the best ... :) Kari', '2006-02-04 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
