(2121624, 288228, 40819, '<td valign="top">As anyone who has read my forum posts knows I love taking pictures of the female form. This is the real glamour shot you get if on your toes while shooting a women. Such reality can not be setup. Excellent timing.<br/> <br/>A womens body is such a creation it dwarfs anything man has tried to accomplish. To capture it in time for all is amazing and to see this lovely women laugh at the time when trying to freeze for a moment that lovely extraordinary functional and sexy being, is priceless.<br/> <br/>Was that over the top? Not when it comes to women.<br/> <br/>Michael</td>', 'As anyone who has read my forum posts knows I love taking pictures of the female form. This is the real glamour shot you get if on your toes while shooting a women. Such reality can not be setup. Excellent timing. A womens body is such a creation it dwarfs anything man has tried to accomplish. To capture it in time for all is amazing and to see this lovely women laugh at the time when trying to freeze for a moment that lovely extraordinary functional and sexy being, is priceless. Was that over the top? Not when it comes to women. Michael', '2006-02-04 14:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
