(2122772, 285349, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract shot.  Though a little busy to look at, my eyes still rest on the middle opening (where I think they''re intended to) so the composition has some strengths.</td>', 'Nice abstract shot.  Though a little busy to look at, my eyes still rest on the middle opening (where I think they''re intended to) so the composition has some strengths.', '2006-02-04 23:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
