(2124470, 288830, 40320, '<td valign="top">I love the texture and tones.  Excellent capture.  It can be difficult photographing someone with glasses due to the glare they tend to produce but yours is a great example of how to work around that problem with the subject.  He reminds me of my own grandfather and his stare he always had right before he spoke about his insight into the conversation.</td>', 'I love the texture and tones.  Excellent capture.  It can be difficult photographing someone with glasses due to the glare they tend to produce but yours is a great example of how to work around that problem with the subject.  He reminds me of my own grandfather and his stare he always had right before he spoke about his insight into the conversation.', '2006-02-05 17:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2124471, 289264, 40320, '<td valign="top">I love trees and how they naturally grow out reaching for their nourishment.  Very simple, slightly off centered but very effective.  Excellent in my book.</td>', 'I love trees and how they naturally grow out reaching for their nourishment.  Very simple, slightly off centered but very effective.  Excellent in my book.', '2006-02-05 17:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2124475, 284608, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oscar can stick around for a looong time.  He''s gorgeous. I do wish we could have seen all his crest, but that, in this instance, is really a minor detail.  9</td>', 'Oscar can stick around for a looong time.  He''s gorgeous. I do wish we could have seen all his crest, but that, in this instance, is really a minor detail.  9', '2006-02-05 17:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2124478, 288574, 14476, '<td valign="top">WShile maybe a little more depth of field would have made this beauty a star, he''s still gorgeous.</td>', 'WShile maybe a little more depth of field would have made this beauty a star, he''s still gorgeous.', '2006-02-05 17:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
