(2126274, 281748, 28299, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to have seen the hawk larger (maybe on the lower left third for interest) and in better focus. Also some saturation to bring out the warm colors. If you do a search through the galleries on hawks/falcons, etc. you will be able to study some amazing captures!</td>', 'Would have liked to have seen the hawk larger (maybe on the lower left third for interest) and in better focus. Also some saturation to bring out the warm colors. If you do a search through the galleries on hawks/falcons, etc. you will be able to study some amazing captures!', '2006-02-06 07:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
