(2126283, 278868, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>This photo does not jump off the page for me. It is subdued, more then enhanced by the heavy orange tonality. It is sharp and more appealing in the left half, but loses my interest to the right.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. This photo does not jump off the page for me. It is subdued, more then enhanced by the heavy orange tonality. It is sharp and more appealing in the left half, but loses my interest to the right.', '2006-02-06 07:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126288, 282156, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>The image of the man firing the gun is exceptional. I am put off by the lack of fire-power in the flash. There is something lacking in the explosiveness I would expect to be conveyed. Is it an edit? Perhaps a darker setting would have made the flash more brilliant. I would also expect to see some lighting effect on the face of the shooter or a puff of smoke or something from the barrel. Of course, I don''t shoot these guns, but my Glock strikes me as more lethal then the photo of this shooting should imply.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. The image of the man firing the gun is exceptional. I am put off by the lack of fire-power in the flash. There is something lacking in the explosiveness I would expect to be conveyed. Is it an edit? Perhaps a darker setting would have made the flash more brilliant. I would also expect to see some lighting effect on the face of the shooter or a puff of smoke or something from the barrel. Of course, I don''t shoot these guns, but my Glock strikes me as more lethal then the photo of this shooting should imply.', '2006-02-06 08:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126291, 287619, 35947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful coloring!</td>', 'Wonderful coloring!', '2006-02-06 08:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126292, 278357, 35947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2006-02-06 08:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126293, 288671, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very creative and wonderfully done!</td>', 'Very creative and wonderfully done!', '2006-02-06 08:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126294, 287830, 28299, '<td valign="top">Like the triangular composition and shallow DOF. They''re really called boobies???</td>', 'Like the triangular composition and shallow DOF. They''re really called boobies???', '2006-02-06 08:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126297, 279947, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>I love the depth of this photo and the coloring conveys and even sense of forebode. There does seem to be a lack of clarity in the forward field that may be over compensated for, so as to seem unreal, rather then the surreal I would personally seek. Very well done in most coveyances.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. I love the depth of this photo and the coloring conveys and even sense of forebode. There does seem to be a lack of clarity in the forward field that may be over compensated for, so as to seem unreal, rather then the surreal I would personally seek. Very well done in most coveyances.', '2006-02-06 08:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126298, 285102, 28299, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed high key, the clarity on your subject is incredible! 9</td>', 'Nicely composed high key, the clarity on your subject is incredible! 9', '2006-02-06 08:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126305, 288990, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>I like it. It is somewhat diluted by the recent posting of the superb ballooner photo still imprinted on my minds eye. But in its own capacity, the depth and coloring are inviting and sharp. I have attempted similar photos, albeit without editing (hmmm....) and am similarly confounded by the loss of detail in the parasails. It seems one must start with an incredibly bright day to get the clarity and then add the ambiance of this work to get stunning. But, I am impressed. Well done.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. I like it. It is somewhat diluted by the recent posting of the superb ballooner photo still imprinted on my minds eye. But in its own capacity, the depth and coloring are inviting and sharp. I have attempted similar photos, albeit without editing (hmmm....) and am similarly confounded by the loss of detail in the parasails. It seems one must start with an incredibly bright day to get the clarity and then add the ambiance of this work to get stunning. But, I am impressed. Well done.', '2006-02-06 08:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126308, 285537, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>The photo deserves top marks for its clarity, coloration and general composition. Were it not for a well manicured lawn I would be greatly taken it. I envision abandoned shacks discovered standing near still water beautifully preserved. Alas, this does it visually, but for me, it a let down conceptually.<br/> <br/>But, man oh man in that reflection perfect or what?! Very inspiring photo and a craft lesson I hope to learn.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. The photo deserves top marks for its clarity, coloration and general composition. Were it not for a well manicured lawn I would be greatly taken it. I envision abandoned shacks discovered standing near still water beautifully preserved. Alas, this does it visually, but for me, it a let down conceptually. But, man oh man in that reflection perfect or what?! Very inspiring photo and a craft lesson I hope to learn.', '2006-02-06 08:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126313, 288561, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>I like the concept alot! The detail is impecable.<br/> <br/>Why is the trombone wet?<br/> <br/>It''s almost like seeing a nude perfectly at ease, purportedly covered in sweat - it is wonderful to see when done well, but better if there is some cogent explanation to carry the photo beyond impact and into an experience.<br/> <br/>It could be oil. It almost looks like shaving from a lathe or other mill work in the tray below. But there is no indication of what that is about either.<br/> <br/>But this is photography, not fiction, and there needn''t always be a plot structure, right? On image alone you have my top mark so far. Well done.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. I like the concept alot! The detail is impecable. Why is the trombone wet? It''s almost like seeing a nude perfectly at ease, purportedly covered in sweat - it is wonderful to see when done well, but better if there is some cogent explanation to carry the photo beyond impact and into an experience. It could be oil. It almost looks like shaving from a lathe or other mill work in the tray below. But there is no indication of what that is about either. But this is photography, not fiction, and there needn''t always be a plot structure, right? On image alone you have my top mark so far. Well done.', '2006-02-06 08:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126314, 283938, 35602, '<td valign="top">What a laugh on this one.  Great humor</td>', 'What a laugh on this one.  Great humor', '2006-02-06 08:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126315, 286402, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>A lovely image well preserving a noble sight.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. A lovely image well preserving a noble sight.', '2006-02-06 08:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126318, 284647, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>This is very cool. It presses into artistic surrealism and does so with confident strokes. Excellent.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. This is very cool. It presses into artistic surrealism and does so with confident strokes. Excellent.', '2006-02-06 08:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126324, 288987, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>Oh my, what a lovely lady. The overall image however, is not quite as convincing. Why? I don''t know. Maybe the skin coloring is missing the glimmer and delicacy to balance the image. I can''t comment on technical issues beyond my technical level. So I can say it comes close to what I imagine would be elegant naughty, but admit that it may be right on technically and visually for others.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. Oh my, what a lovely lady. The overall image however, is not quite as convincing. Why? I don''t know. Maybe the skin coloring is missing the glimmer and delicacy to balance the image. I can''t comment on technical issues beyond my technical level. So I can say it comes close to what I imagine would be elegant naughty, but admit that it may be right on technically and visually for others.', '2006-02-06 08:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126330, 285763, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>I like the perspective and coloring from the pilars. I think they could have provided the shot more. Not being on the shooting end, I can''t say what options were available. But the ocean expanse and wash out of the sky seems to leave the front half of the photo doing all of the work. A nice shot all in all, but missing something in tension.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. I like the perspective and coloring from the pilars. I think they could have provided the shot more. Not being on the shooting end, I can''t say what options were available. But the ocean expanse and wash out of the sky seems to leave the front half of the photo doing all of the work. A nice shot all in all, but missing something in tension.', '2006-02-06 08:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126334, 289163, 34438, '<td valign="top">Wow. Nice photograph. There is nothing terribly unique here conceptually. But where is there something new conceptually. For what it presents, it is extremely compelling and is a shot I would love to say I had taken. Right time, right place, right technique as far as my amature eye can discern. Outstanding shot.</td>', 'Wow. Nice photograph. There is nothing terribly unique here conceptually. But where is there something new conceptually. For what it presents, it is extremely compelling and is a shot I would love to say I had taken. Right time, right place, right technique as far as my amature eye can discern. Outstanding shot.', '2006-02-06 08:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126339, 289250, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>I like the mood of this picture a great deal. The straggly tree works with the wire fence in front and the whole is well balances, especially in tonal qualities working with the image effectively.<br/> <br/>Nice work!</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. I like the mood of this picture a great deal. The straggly tree works with the wire fence in front and the whole is well balances, especially in tonal qualities working with the image effectively. Nice work!', '2006-02-06 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126342, 288936, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>This is what I would expect to see in a gallery. Very nice, well executed. I lack only for the ice or snow more visible lower frame. Maybe there was none. Nevertheless, tonal quality consistent with concept and clarity is outstanding. Very enjoyable image.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. This is what I would expect to see in a gallery. Very nice, well executed. I lack only for the ice or snow more visible lower frame. Maybe there was none. Nevertheless, tonal quality consistent with concept and clarity is outstanding. Very enjoyable image.', '2006-02-06 08:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126346, 287327, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>I''ve shot a lot of flower. They''re such well behaved models and cheap too, with a beauty from which few can detract. An excellent image that is what one would see exactly. That is my only issue. I like to be startled, even by a flower.<br/> <br/>However excellent the technique, I am not getting that wow response. It is likey only me. Excellent photography.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. I''ve shot a lot of flower. They''re such well behaved models and cheap too, with a beauty from which few can detract. An excellent image that is what one would see exactly. That is my only issue. I like to be startled, even by a flower. However excellent the technique, I am not getting that wow response. It is likey only me. Excellent photography.', '2006-02-06 08:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126353, 285159, 34438, '<td valign="top">I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique.<br/> <br/>Oh my, this is tough. It''s compelling conceptually and something I want to review again. The detail on the top rail is an unqualified sucess. The apparent blood down the stairs is suggestive, brought into focus by the title. That''s the point then isn''t it. Would I have gotten it without the title? Subliminally, the message is there. The shifted focus puts the artistic element of the piece into strong contention. I must give you the nod and put my slight preference for greater clarity on at least one stair, to the side of art. Very nice.</td>', 'I am new here and relatively so to serious photography; so, I will offer only my response, not a critique. Oh my, this is tough. It''s compelling conceptually and something I want to review again. The detail on the top rail is an unqualified sucess. The apparent blood down the stairs is suggestive, brought into focus by the title. That''s the point then isn''t it. Would I have gotten it without the title? Subliminally, the message is there. The shifted focus puts the artistic element of the piece into strong contention. I must give you the nod and put my slight preference for greater clarity on at least one stair, to the side of art. Very nice.', '2006-02-06 08:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126358, 287488, 34438, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Excellent photograph. Don''t know what to say beyond that. It''s not my thing. Screaming must be spontaneous or suggested by circumstance. Beyond that, it''s like making faces in the mirror. Which is purely one man''s humble opinion, and speaks not at all to the photographic technique, which strikes my untrained eye as exceptional.</td>', 'Hmmm. Excellent photograph. Don''t know what to say beyond that. It''s not my thing. Screaming must be spontaneous or suggested by circumstance. Beyond that, it''s like making faces in the mirror. Which is purely one man''s humble opinion, and speaks not at all to the photographic technique, which strikes my untrained eye as exceptional.', '2006-02-06 08:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126363, 287072, 34438, '<td valign="top">I do like minimalism. Perhaps more so then the densely subtle. I would hand this on my wall. It is a form that requires patience and sincere introspection to observe the impression made. I hope others appreciate it as much as do I.</td>', 'I do like minimalism. Perhaps more so then the densely subtle. I would hand this on my wall. It is a form that requires patience and sincere introspection to observe the impression made. I hope others appreciate it as much as do I.', '2006-02-06 08:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126367, 286487, 34438, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I prefer greater contrast in shadows to balance shots like this. The vastness of the background puts all the pressure on the upper structure itself to carry the image. I''m not quite there with you, but know well that others will find the balance outstanding.</td>', 'Nicely done. I prefer greater contrast in shadows to balance shots like this. The vastness of the background puts all the pressure on the upper structure itself to carry the image. I''m not quite there with you, but know well that others will find the balance outstanding.', '2006-02-06 08:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126371, 288396, 34438, '<td valign="top">I like it. I can''t draw on any experise in this kind of shot to evaluate it''s technical merit, so I can only say that it works for me. Makes me want to cheer too. Nice shot!</td>', 'I like it. I can''t draw on any experise in this kind of shot to evaluate it''s technical merit, so I can only say that it works for me. Makes me want to cheer too. Nice shot!', '2006-02-06 09:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126374, 284901, 34438, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Reminds me of Adams. Striking motion balance a stolid line of ominous trees and a lighthouse far off but still "part of" the whole. This photo too, I would hope to make some day. It is inspiring to absorb the craft that goes into this shot. Excellent to my eye and my mind''s eye. Wow.</td>', 'Very nice. Reminds me of Adams. Striking motion balance a stolid line of ominous trees and a lighthouse far off but still "part of" the whole. This photo too, I would hope to make some day. It is inspiring to absorb the craft that goes into this shot. Excellent to my eye and my mind''s eye. Wow.', '2006-02-06 09:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126378, 280509, 34438, '<td valign="top">Egad it comes so close to slapping me silly. I love it. But I wish it to be more. It all stands out so wonderfully except the counterpoint. And I doubt it''s the photographer here. There is too much quality surrounding. If only for a bit less overcast, a slight break in the clouds to iluminate 3 degrees more the images reflecting. Very inspired and inspiring overall.</td>', 'Egad it comes so close to slapping me silly. I love it. But I wish it to be more. It all stands out so wonderfully except the counterpoint. And I doubt it''s the photographer here. There is too much quality surrounding. If only for a bit less overcast, a slight break in the clouds to iluminate 3 degrees more the images reflecting. Very inspired and inspiring overall.', '2006-02-06 09:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126389, 287746, 34438, '<td valign="top">I was about to laugh out loud until I read the title. There is a mischevious look on mom''s face and the youngster looks like he just got a way with an evil deed and mom is shutting him up and savoring the moment. But then, yes, then I see blood on the finger and the title and I have lost the moment. But it is a memorable image, extremely well done overall. If you put the blood on the finger, we have wildly different impressions of the scene, which is OK too. But I would have preferred the blood to be someone elses!</td>', 'I was about to laugh out loud until I read the title. There is a mischevious look on mom''s face and the youngster looks like he just got a way with an evil deed and mom is shutting him up and savoring the moment. But then, yes, then I see blood on the finger and the title and I have lost the moment. But it is a memorable image, extremely well done overall. If you put the blood on the finger, we have wildly different impressions of the scene, which is OK too. But I would have preferred the blood to be someone elses!', '2006-02-06 09:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126395, 286041, 34438, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph. Good color. Nice motion in the ocean. It just doesn''t move around to look at it though. And guess what, I shoot shots that don''t move me around either, no matter how much I want them to.</td>', 'Nice photograph. Good color. Nice motion in the ocean. It just doesn''t move around to look at it though. And guess what, I shoot shots that don''t move me around either, no matter how much I want them to.', '2006-02-06 09:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126398, 285344, 18207, '<td valign="top">Very good persective for this kind of shots.</td>', 'Very good persective for this kind of shots.', '2006-02-06 09:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126400, 288498, 34438, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Not quite as strong as some of the other similarly toned expressions. But I say that guardedly, because I would be thrilled to take such a shot. Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Not quite as strong as some of the other similarly toned expressions. But I say that guardedly, because I would be thrilled to take such a shot. Well done.', '2006-02-06 09:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126405, 284241, 18207, '<td valign="top">As for my taste, tilted horizon doesn''t add to the image, which would be good, anyway.</td>', 'As for my taste, tilted horizon doesn''t add to the image, which would be good, anyway.', '2006-02-06 09:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126407, 289261, 34438, '<td valign="top">I like cats. I like photos of cats. I like cats that are acrobatic or silly or in unusual circumstance. A pisse off cat is simply not new. They are arrogant beasts anyway, and pissed off is part of the routine.<br/> <br/>Good photo of the cat but the carpet detracts I think.</td>', 'I like cats. I like photos of cats. I like cats that are acrobatic or silly or in unusual circumstance. A pisse off cat is simply not new. They are arrogant beasts anyway, and pissed off is part of the routine. Good photo of the cat but the carpet detracts I think.', '2006-02-06 09:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126413, 281561, 34438, '<td valign="top">Very cool, professional quality. But, Got Milk? Nope. I will have to try this kind of shot sometime or seek out the maker to tell me how it is done. It seems very strong technically but not a giant leap conceptually.</td>', 'Very cool, professional quality. But, Got Milk? Nope. I will have to try this kind of shot sometime or seek out the maker to tell me how it is done. It seems very strong technically but not a giant leap conceptually.', '2006-02-06 09:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126419, 288246, 18207, '<td valign="top">Good selection of shutter speed; shows flow while keeping the details instead of blurring the whole water surface with longer expo. Grats.</td>', 'Good selection of shutter speed; shows flow while keeping the details instead of blurring the whole water surface with longer expo. Grats.', '2006-02-06 09:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126427, 283578, 18207, '<td valign="top">Great colors on the sky.</td>', 'Great colors on the sky.', '2006-02-06 09:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126430, 288274, 34438, '<td valign="top">I like it. I wish I knew more about how it was done so I could deliberate intelligently about those few aspects that don''t quite ring true, but they are subtle and more about the composited whole then any particular sub-element. Very nice work overall to my untrained eye.</td>', 'I like it. I wish I knew more about how it was done so I could deliberate intelligently about those few aspects that don''t quite ring true, but they are subtle and more about the composited whole then any particular sub-element. Very nice work overall to my untrained eye.', '2006-02-06 09:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126433, 280444, 509, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I like the composition as well.</td>', 'Great capture, I like the composition as well.', '2006-02-06 09:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126435, 281630, 34438, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo and lovely model. What a smile and conveyance of warmth and innocence. My only distraction is the nose area which seems slightly blurred or lacking in depth. Maybe it''s me. Generally speaking, I love the shot.</td>', 'Very nice photo and lovely model. What a smile and conveyance of warmth and innocence. My only distraction is the nose area which seems slightly blurred or lacking in depth. Maybe it''s me. Generally speaking, I love the shot.', '2006-02-06 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126436, 288619, 509, '<td valign="top">The greyish colors and tonality work well here, looks like a very peaceful scene.</td>', 'The greyish colors and tonality work well here, looks like a very peaceful scene.', '2006-02-06 09:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126440, 285757, 509, '<td valign="top">Very cool - is the whole background a printed image?  Great effect.</td>', 'Very cool - is the whole background a printed image?  Great effect.', '2006-02-06 09:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126442, 284213, 18207, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately there''s a big amount of compression artifacts. The shot itself is very good, anyway.</td>', 'Unfortunately there''s a big amount of compression artifacts. The shot itself is very good, anyway.', '2006-02-06 09:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126447, 288329, 509, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, great closeup!</td>', 'Very sharp, great closeup!', '2006-02-06 09:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126449, 288957, 18207, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what you''re telling with the way too high contrast.</td>', 'I don''t understand what you''re telling with the way too high contrast.', '2006-02-06 09:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126451, 282536, 18207, '<td valign="top">Yes. Size.</td>', 'Yes. Size.', '2006-02-06 09:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126454, 280133, 18207, '<td valign="top">The noise works very well on darker areas like ground or trees but for sky something else should have been used to achieve that painting-like effect.</td>', 'The noise works very well on darker areas like ground or trees but for sky something else should have been used to achieve that painting-like effect.', '2006-02-06 09:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126460, 289255, 18207, '<td valign="top">Amazing reflection. Somehow I have the feeling that this is upside down. I don''t know why, maybe the colors/tones are more alive in the bottom part.</td>', 'Amazing reflection. Somehow I have the feeling that this is upside down. I don''t know why, maybe the colors/tones are more alive in the bottom part.', '2006-02-06 09:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126465, 286775, 18207, '<td valign="top">Size matters.</td>', 'Size matters.', '2006-02-06 09:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126490, 288008, 39349, '<td valign="top">I really like the blue tone you''ve captured here. I can almost feel how cold it is out there. I also like the way you composed the shot, it keeps my eye moving through it. Well done.</td>', 'I really like the blue tone you''ve captured here. I can almost feel how cold it is out there. I also like the way you composed the shot, it keeps my eye moving through it. Well done.', '2006-02-06 10:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
