(2126520, 289255, 32084, '<td valign="top">The clarity is great and wow what a scene to come upon, but there is so much going on it is difficult to see what your point is interest is in this shot.</td>', 'The clarity is great and wow what a scene to come upon, but there is so much going on it is difficult to see what your point is interest is in this shot.', '2006-02-06 10:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
