(2126563, 288453, 43437, '<td valign="top">very nice pose, great smile.  The only thing I  can see is the blury spot in the hair up front.  Makes your focus look a little off.</td>', 'very nice pose, great smile.  The only thing I  can see is the blury spot in the hair up front.  Makes your focus look a little off.', '2006-02-06 10:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
