(2126642, 276743, 43437, '<td valign="top">yes, yes I do want one.  Looks like its straight out of a bacardi advertisement.  Makes me want one, and its 9 in the morning!  Mission accomplished Id say 10</td>', 'yes, yes I do want one.  Looks like its straight out of a bacardi advertisement.  Makes me want one, and its 9 in the morning!  Mission accomplished Id say 10', '2006-02-06 11:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
