(2126686, 289349, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the simple nature of this and how its off center to show others blurred in the background.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the simple nature of this and how its off center to show others blurred in the background.', '2006-02-06 11:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
