(2126711, 282524, 42638, '<td valign="top">Good use of shadows in this one. Love the composition.</td>', 'Good use of shadows in this one. Love the composition.', '2006-02-06 11:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126736, 287315, 33672, '<td valign="top">May be a while......Great idea and execution.</td>', 'May be a while......Great idea and execution.', '2006-02-06 11:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126752, 289381, 43437, '<td valign="top">beautiful.  Incredible capture, the feathers are so...and the eyes are....anyway a new fave and a 10 from me.</td>', 'beautiful.  Incredible capture, the feathers are so...and the eyes are....anyway a new fave and a 10 from me.', '2006-02-06 11:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126764, 282280, 2223, '<td valign="top">Instant fav! Amazing, just freakin amazing!</td>', 'Instant fav! Amazing, just freakin amazing!', '2006-02-06 12:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126771, 286499, 37961, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle and action. One of my top 10 pics in the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent angle and action. One of my top 10 pics in the challenge.', '2006-02-06 12:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126784, 289299, 42792, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught her rather cute expression which is really endearing (good trying something new).  That''s the element that makes this image interesting.  I would just crop off the top a little more so the impact of the eyes is instant.  Otherwise nice compo and details in the red feathers.</td>', 'You''ve caught her rather cute expression which is really endearing (good trying something new).  That''s the element that makes this image interesting.  I would just crop off the top a little more so the impact of the eyes is instant.  Otherwise nice compo and details in the red feathers.', '2006-02-06 12:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126785, 288605, 42792, '<td valign="top">Really nice details and light.</td>', 'Really nice details and light.', '2006-02-06 12:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126797, 288880, 42792, '<td valign="top">Really nice sunset somewhat marred by the foreground.  Would probably be better to just crop off the foreground up to where the haystack is.</td>', 'Really nice sunset somewhat marred by the foreground.  Would probably be better to just crop off the foreground up to where the haystack is.', '2006-02-06 12:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126860, 289097, 43437, '<td valign="top">Love the expression, very thoughtful and perplexed.  The only thing I would change would be to take his hood off, its a cute hat and the hood hides an interesting element.</td>', 'Love the expression, very thoughtful and perplexed.  The only thing I would change would be to take his hood off, its a cute hat and the hood hides an interesting element.', '2006-02-06 12:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126873, 289099, 43437, '<td valign="top">I like your horizon and the setup with the boat. I really like your colors, especially at the top of the frame.  The red gets grainy down on the bottom right side and there is a bit of a glow around the top of the sail.  Can you see any of the boat in the original?  If so you might want to try to bring out just a hint of the shape to give the black water a little variation</td>', 'I like your horizon and the setup with the boat. I really like your colors, especially at the top of the frame.  The red gets grainy down on the bottom right side and there is a bit of a glow around the top of the sail.  Can you see any of the boat in the original?  If so you might want to try to bring out just a hint of the shape to give the black water a little variation', '2006-02-06 12:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126881, 286703, 43437, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, I like how you can see the road leading back into the pic.  The trees have halos from sharpening around them and if the stars were crisp this picture would have been incredible.</td>', 'Nice setup, I like how you can see the road leading back into the pic.  The trees have halos from sharpening around them and if the stars were crisp this picture would have been incredible.', '2006-02-06 13:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126889, 286568, 48115, '<td valign="top">are those open eyes.. if so poor guy..</td>', 'are those open eyes.. if so poor guy..', '2006-02-06 13:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126903, 289163, 43437, '<td valign="top">very peaceful looking.  I like this in black and white.  If I could have a wish for this it would be that the reflection of the clouds was crisper or a shot with more of the sky and croped before the first bright spot in the water.  The clouds are incredible.  Very nice tones.</td>', 'very peaceful looking.  I like this in black and white.  If I could have a wish for this it would be that the reflection of the clouds was crisper or a shot with more of the sky and croped before the first bright spot in the water.  The clouds are incredible.  Very nice tones.', '2006-02-06 13:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126957, 288257, 33672, '<td valign="top">Tree ruins the comp.... sorry.</td>', 'Tree ruins the comp.... sorry.', '2006-02-06 13:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126967, 288830, 31443, '<td valign="top">Brilliant post process!</td>', 'Brilliant post process!', '2006-02-06 13:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2126979, 288867, 24890, '<td valign="top">A little too gray... Needs more contrast. 5</td>', 'A little too gray... Needs more contrast. 5', '2006-02-06 13:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2127003, 276288, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot. I think a bit more space underneath the bottom arrow would have been better.</td>', 'Nice clean shot. I think a bit more space underneath the bottom arrow would have been better.', '2006-02-06 14:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2127017, 287576, 14476, '<td valign="top">nicely interpreted.</td>', 'nicely interpreted.', '2006-02-06 14:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2127018, 280138, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice and soft overall look, like it lots!</td>', 'Nice and soft overall look, like it lots!', '2006-02-06 14:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
