(2127150, 288637, 31917, '<td valign="top">love the tones and crisp lines.  I would love to see this cropped along the top of the mirror horizontally.  it will undate the photo by not allowing you to know what year of car it is since it is a newer style mirror.  and it will make the shot feel longer and feel like the dogs face is pointing you through the picture.   . .i think.  lol.  nice shot!</td>', 'love the tones and crisp lines.  I would love to see this cropped along the top of the mirror horizontally.  it will undate the photo by not allowing you to know what year of car it is since it is a newer style mirror.  and it will make the shot feel longer and feel like the dogs face is pointing you through the picture.   . .i think.  lol.  nice shot!', '2006-02-06 15:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
