(2128659, 275965, 17507, '<td valign="top">mmm bacon</td>', 'mmm bacon', '2006-02-07 01:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128661, 283068, 17507, '<td valign="top">it''s too bad you can''t embed a MIDI file in the title &gt;_&lt;</td>', 'it''s too bad you can''t embed a MIDI file in the title >_<', '2006-02-07 01:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128663, 288556, 43156, '<td valign="top">Excellent, Just like a post card.</td>', 'Excellent, Just like a post card.', '2006-02-07 01:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128670, 288204, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice and colorful take on a gloomy gray day!</td>', 'Nice and colorful take on a gloomy gray day!', '2006-02-07 01:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128731, 283216, 48545, '<td valign="top">brilliant photo, a lovely capture and the background compliments the bird perfectly</td>', 'brilliant photo, a lovely capture and the background compliments the bird perfectly', '2006-02-07 02:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128757, 279947, 39993, '<td valign="top">:} Orgasmic. One can almost see tomorrow.<br/>Somehow reminds me of God''s Window in Mpumalanga.</td>', ':} Orgasmic. One can almost see tomorrow.Somehow reminds me of God''s Window in Mpumalanga.', '2006-02-07 02:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128828, 288199, 18207, '<td valign="top">It seems for me that selective desat left a bit of green color cast on the ape which ruins the plan. Removing it would have bumped this pic up.</td>', 'It seems for me that selective desat left a bit of green color cast on the ape which ruins the plan. Removing it would have bumped this pic up.', '2006-02-07 04:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128829, 288646, 18207, '<td valign="top">Falling snow is a minus for me. Otherwise, I like this.</td>', 'Falling snow is a minus for me. Otherwise, I like this.', '2006-02-07 04:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128831, 289264, 18207, '<td valign="top">Without fine details on the branches I can only give it a 6.</td>', 'Without fine details on the branches I can only give it a 6.', '2006-02-07 04:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128834, 288307, 18207, '<td valign="top">Nice play with the clouds. I mean their shadows of course.</td>', 'Nice play with the clouds. I mean their shadows of course.', '2006-02-07 04:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128837, 288320, 18207, '<td valign="top">Nice fish-eye. Is this the newly acquired Sigma 10-20? ;)</td>', 'Nice fish-eye. Is this the newly acquired Sigma 10-20? ;)', '2006-02-07 04:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128838, 286851, 18207, '<td valign="top">Leaving the left eye in semi-shadow resulted in a strange effect, I''d reconsider the lighting.</td>', 'Leaving the left eye in semi-shadow resulted in a strange effect, I''d reconsider the lighting.', '2006-02-07 04:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128839, 287575, 18207, '<td valign="top">The position of the lamppost is a big drawback here.</td>', 'The position of the lamppost is a big drawback here.', '2006-02-07 04:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128849, 287981, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love the rods conforming to the angles of the sun''s rays.  This has to be John White ... not just because of the location, but also because of the meticulous composition and the restraint in processing.  Most people would have screwed this up with heavy-handed processing, and you didn''t.  Beautiful shot of one of the world''s great pastimes; beach fishing.  9.</td>', 'Love the rods conforming to the angles of the sun''s rays.  This has to be John White ... not just because of the location, but also because of the meticulous composition and the restraint in processing.  Most people would have screwed this up with heavy-handed processing, and you didn''t.  Beautiful shot of one of the world''s great pastimes; beach fishing.  9.', '2006-02-07 04:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128851, 288078, 25355, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the border....</td>', 'Not sure about the border....', '2006-02-07 04:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128858, 287136, 25355, '<td valign="top">Very good motion panning shot.</td>', 'Very good motion panning shot.', '2006-02-07 04:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128859, 287024, 25355, '<td valign="top">Who is he?</td>', 'Who is he?', '2006-02-07 04:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128861, 288493, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lots of lovely allegorical possibilities here.  I do like the processing with the blue/black tone.  Great composition/opportunism, but even better you knew what you were seeing and exactly how to capture and present it.  8</td>', 'Lots of lovely allegorical possibilities here.  I do like the processing with the blue/black tone.  Great composition/opportunism, but even better you knew what you were seeing and exactly how to capture and present it.  8', '2006-02-07 04:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128866, 288988, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific forms and textures, as well as the great colour.  Love the processing, too.  Such an interesting image made from just a few well chosen and well positioned elements.  8.</td>', 'Terrific forms and textures, as well as the great colour.  Love the processing, too.  Such an interesting image made from just a few well chosen and well positioned elements.  8.', '2006-02-07 04:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128868, 278763, 30364, '<td valign="top">Fabulous light, nice composition, and a very fine and interesting landscape.  8</td>', 'Fabulous light, nice composition, and a very fine and interesting landscape.  8', '2006-02-07 04:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128870, 287750, 25355, '<td valign="top">Isn''t there a rule against depicting drug use? After, caffeine is a drug ;-))</td>', 'Isn''t there a rule against depicting drug use? After, caffeine is a drug ;-))', '2006-02-07 04:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128873, 286005, 25355, '<td valign="top">Even his dish and water bowl have gone... ;-0</td>', 'Even his dish and water bowl have gone... ;-0', '2006-02-07 04:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128874, 276768, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, moody tribute to the spirit of a formal garden, with the added whimsy of the tools and wheelbarrow.  Like catching a diva backstage in her underwear.  9.</td>', 'Beautiful, moody tribute to the spirit of a formal garden, with the added whimsy of the tools and wheelbarrow.  Like catching a diva backstage in her underwear.  9.', '2006-02-07 04:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128877, 287636, 25355, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve lost too much detail in the white head feathers, but this may be due to the distance you had to shoot from.</td>', 'I think you''ve lost too much detail in the white head feathers, but this may be due to the distance you had to shoot from.', '2006-02-07 04:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128880, 277479, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely photograph, and an absolutely beautiful title (a great example to those poor, dull souls who say "the title is not important").  I''m no expert, but the tonal control in this photograph strikes me as masterful.  And the really great thing is that the meaning of the photograph is accessible, even without the title.  9.</td>', 'Lovely photograph, and an absolutely beautiful title (a great example to those poor, dull souls who say "the title is not important").  I''m no expert, but the tonal control in this photograph strikes me as masterful.  And the really great thing is that the meaning of the photograph is accessible, even without the title.  9.', '2006-02-07 05:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128885, 288498, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very fine, thoughtful composition.  I applaud the deft use of so few elements to suggest a meaning to the viewer, especially as you have not told the whole story, but have left something to the viewer''s imagination.  So good to see a mood established without the use of brutal, Wagnerian post-processing.  9.</td>', 'Very fine, thoughtful composition.  I applaud the deft use of so few elements to suggest a meaning to the viewer, especially as you have not told the whole story, but have left something to the viewer''s imagination.  So good to see a mood established without the use of brutal, Wagnerian post-processing.  9.', '2006-02-07 05:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128887, 286487, 18207, '<td valign="top">Needs some more contrast or a better way of BW conversion.</td>', 'Needs some more contrast or a better way of BW conversion.', '2006-02-07 05:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128888, 288637, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourite images in this challenge.  Brilliant composition, and for once the use of moderately stark and dramatic post-processing is justified.  The effect is a little reminiscent of one of those heroic posters much loved by the propagandists of the old Soviet Union - hope that doesn''t offend; they were often masterpieces of graphic design.  It''s a beautiful work.  10.</td>', 'This is one of my favourite images in this challenge.  Brilliant composition, and for once the use of moderately stark and dramatic post-processing is justified.  The effect is a little reminiscent of one of those heroic posters much loved by the propagandists of the old Soviet Union - hope that doesn''t offend; they were often masterpieces of graphic design.  It''s a beautiful work.  10.', '2006-02-07 05:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128892, 281051, 30364, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful, unusual image.  The totally engaging expressions on the two faces make it possible for the protagonist to live happily right in the centre and with his back to the camera.  That''s quite an achievement.  8</td>', 'Such a wonderful, unusual image.  The totally engaging expressions on the two faces make it possible for the protagonist to live happily right in the centre and with his back to the camera.  That''s quite an achievement.  8', '2006-02-07 05:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128893, 287414, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love this portrait.  Instead of just showing us what the subject looks like, it tells us something of who she is.  That''s rare and welcome.  8.</td>', 'Love this portrait.  Instead of just showing us what the subject looks like, it tells us something of who she is.  That''s rare and welcome.  8.', '2006-02-07 05:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128894, 287447, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and a really interesting study of forms and tetures.  8.</td>', 'Nice composition and a really interesting study of forms and tetures.  8.', '2006-02-07 05:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128896, 279774, 18207, '<td valign="top">How comes that only one of the puppies is blurry?</td>', 'How comes that only one of the puppies is blurry?', '2006-02-07 05:27:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2128899, 288933, 48545, '<td valign="top">I really like snowboard pictures, I''d like to see more of the face and a fill-in flash might have worked a treat here.  Is that allowed during a competition?</td>', 'I really like snowboard pictures, I''d like to see more of the face and a fill-in flash might have worked a treat here.  Is that allowed during a competition?', '2006-02-07 05:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128900, 280999, 48545, '<td valign="top">nice, I''d like the crop a little tighter to make the size of the wave even more impressive</td>', 'nice, I''d like the crop a little tighter to make the size of the wave even more impressive', '2006-02-07 05:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128901, 287818, 48545, '<td valign="top">great photograph, it would be interesting to see this in different hues</td>', 'great photograph, it would be interesting to see this in different hues', '2006-02-07 05:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128902, 287200, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  I think you''ve replicated all that''s great about some of the best B&amp;W film images.  Model''s pretty impressive, too.  8</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  I think you''ve replicated all that''s great about some of the best B&W film images.  Model''s pretty impressive, too.  8', '2006-02-07 05:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128903, 288117, 48545, '<td valign="top">nice photo, compared to some other pictures, the colours come across a little flat, however I can''t decide whether this adds to the grubbiness of the little kid</td>', 'nice photo, compared to some other pictures, the colours come across a little flat, however I can''t decide whether this adds to the grubbiness of the little kid', '2006-02-07 05:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128904, 287096, 48545, '<td valign="top">nice subject, the clouds are beautiful, possibly making them more dramatic would enhance the photo more.</td>', 'nice subject, the clouds are beautiful, possibly making them more dramatic would enhance the photo more.', '2006-02-07 05:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128906, 284146, 48545, '<td valign="top">a little sharp in the foreground would be nice as the shot isn''t overwhelmingly captivating, perfect contrast and exposure is a must</td>', 'a little sharp in the foreground would be nice as the shot isn''t overwhelmingly captivating, perfect contrast and exposure is a must', '2006-02-07 05:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128907, 286106, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautifully structured image.  Nice composition, excellent exposure and really fine processing.  The result is, to my admittedly non-expert eye, perfect tonal control.  9.</td>', 'Beautifully structured image.  Nice composition, excellent exposure and really fine processing.  The result is, to my admittedly non-expert eye, perfect tonal control.  9.', '2006-02-07 05:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128908, 287315, 18207, '<td valign="top">Hi, Cole!<br/>Sorry to say that, I don''t feel it fair to use the same set and partly the same story as in Oops! II. The image itself would have got a 7 or even an 8, I love the expression of the model again. Because of the mentioned reasons I gave you a 6 only.</td>', 'Hi, Cole!Sorry to say that, I don''t feel it fair to use the same set and partly the same story as in Oops! II. The image itself would have got a 7 or even an 8, I love the expression of the model again. Because of the mentioned reasons I gave you a 6 only.', '2006-02-07 05:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128909, 288593, 18207, '<td valign="top">The fading at the edges do not work for me. I''d like it way better without it.</td>', 'The fading at the edges do not work for me. I''d like it way better without it.', '2006-02-07 05:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128910, 286515, 18207, '<td valign="top">I think the focus is a bit off. Anyway, I like it.</td>', 'I think the focus is a bit off. Anyway, I like it.', '2006-02-07 05:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128911, 276012, 48545, '<td valign="top">try to use as much of the wide that you''re allowed, there doesn''t appear to be a subject or a story of any sorts in this photo</td>', 'try to use as much of the wide that you''re allowed, there doesn''t appear to be a subject or a story of any sorts in this photo', '2006-02-07 05:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128913, 288613, 48545, '<td valign="top">This looks like a snapshot, the central horizon doesn''t make for an interesting photo, try using the rule of thirds on your photograph</td>', 'This looks like a snapshot, the central horizon doesn''t make for an interesting photo, try using the rule of thirds on your photograph', '2006-02-07 05:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128914, 288555, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, soaring semi-abstract image.  The structure may have provided the lines and the inspiration, but the photographer''s composition and processing did full justice to the opportunity.  You''ve found a very organic point-of-view of this mathematically interesting curve.  The effect is to equally suggest both design in nature, and nature in design.  10.</td>', 'Beautiful, soaring semi-abstract image.  The structure may have provided the lines and the inspiration, but the photographer''s composition and processing did full justice to the opportunity.  You''ve found a very organic point-of-view of this mathematically interesting curve.  The effect is to equally suggest both design in nature, and nature in design.  10.', '2006-02-07 05:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128917, 289221, 30364, '<td valign="top">What a striking photograph.  The swimmer''s expressionless face, the reflective goggles, and of course the trail of air bubbles combine to create a slightly alien feel.  The composition/crop is terrific as well.  I can''t work out why the pattern visible between her arms is not seen in the general background.  But I don''t particularly care about that.  9.</td>', 'What a striking photograph.  The swimmer''s expressionless face, the reflective goggles, and of course the trail of air bubbles combine to create a slightly alien feel.  The composition/crop is terrific as well.  I can''t work out why the pattern visible between her arms is not seen in the general background.  But I don''t particularly care about that.  9.', '2006-02-07 05:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128918, 280554, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes!  9.</td>', 'Yes!  9.', '2006-02-07 05:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128952, 285010, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful cat portrait.</td>', 'What a beautiful cat portrait.', '2006-02-07 06:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128970, 280536, 48545, '<td valign="top">nice idea however the main focus is too dark and the first pole is out of focus.  If the main subject was lighter or the first pole was in focus would have added to this photo</td>', 'nice idea however the main focus is too dark and the first pole is out of focus.  If the main subject was lighter or the first pole was in focus would have added to this photo', '2006-02-07 06:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128971, 289305, 48545, '<td valign="top">nice pose however not quite crisp enough to make this great</td>', 'nice pose however not quite crisp enough to make this great', '2006-02-07 06:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128975, 287411, 48545, '<td valign="top">I''d have removed a few of the hotspots, also the focus / dof doesn''t make this photo very pleasing to the eye</td>', 'I''d have removed a few of the hotspots, also the focus / dof doesn''t make this photo very pleasing to the eye', '2006-02-07 06:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128978, 289087, 39993, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2006-02-07 07:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128989, 289114, 22459, '<td valign="top">great B/W crisp and clean, well done.</td>', 'great B/W crisp and clean, well done.', '2006-02-07 07:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128990, 280544, 39993, '<td valign="top">lurve the colors.</td>', 'lurve the colors.', '2006-02-07 07:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2128999, 289264, 28299, '<td valign="top">like the high key effect, clarity and compostion. Nice!</td>', 'like the high key effect, clarity and compostion. Nice!', '2006-02-07 07:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129002, 278902, 48545, '<td valign="top">great use of the fisheye, I like the random people they really add to the photo</td>', 'great use of the fisheye, I like the random people they really add to the photo', '2006-02-07 07:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129003, 283068, 48545, '<td valign="top">shocking title :) nice detail</td>', 'shocking title :) nice detail', '2006-02-07 07:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129005, 288937, 28299, '<td valign="top">This is such a sweet picture and the clarity on the little one is incredible. 9</td>', 'This is such a sweet picture and the clarity on the little one is incredible. 9', '2006-02-07 07:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129007, 289010, 28299, '<td valign="top">very artsy appeal. 8</td>', 'very artsy appeal. 8', '2006-02-07 07:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129010, 284108, 48545, '<td valign="top">I like the single white flower, however the border doesn''t add anything to the photo</td>', 'I like the single white flower, however the border doesn''t add anything to the photo', '2006-02-07 07:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129012, 287828, 48545, '<td valign="top">matching door and bag, sharper focus would have improved this photo</td>', 'matching door and bag, sharper focus would have improved this photo', '2006-02-07 07:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129014, 287856, 48545, '<td valign="top">unfortunately this isn''t an interesting photo - however I did try to spot a beaver in there</td>', 'unfortunately this isn''t an interesting photo - however I did try to spot a beaver in there', '2006-02-07 07:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129016, 284223, 28299, '<td valign="top">Cute. How did you get him/her to be such a cooperative model?</td>', 'Cute. How did you get him/her to be such a cooperative model?', '2006-02-07 07:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129019, 289343, 48545, '<td valign="top">Personally the photo should sell itself, the title did make me smile though</td>', 'Personally the photo should sell itself, the title did make me smile though', '2006-02-07 07:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129020, 288830, 28299, '<td valign="top">Nice! 9</td>', 'Nice! 9', '2006-02-07 07:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129024, 279615, 48545, '<td valign="top">you might have got away with this photo more in the abstract or blue challenges, it really isn''t pleasing on the eye</td>', 'you might have got away with this photo more in the abstract or blue challenges, it really isn''t pleasing on the eye', '2006-02-07 07:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129026, 288881, 48545, '<td valign="top">exposure needs to be set better on the bottles or maybe a slightly higher view point to extend the shadow cast on the table</td>', 'exposure needs to be set better on the bottles or maybe a slightly higher view point to extend the shadow cast on the table', '2006-02-07 07:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129031, 277059, 48545, '<td valign="top">there is nothing really that attacts the viewer into the photo, the eyes look like they have been affected by a flash</td>', 'there is nothing really that attacts the viewer into the photo, the eyes look like they have been affected by a flash', '2006-02-07 07:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129033, 287867, 48545, '<td valign="top">its a nice snapshot however doesn''t really push any photographic prowess compared to many of the other photos in this challenge</td>', 'its a nice snapshot however doesn''t really push any photographic prowess compared to many of the other photos in this challenge', '2006-02-07 07:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129035, 288695, 48545, '<td valign="top">lacking any really focusing, unfortunately as it could have been an exciting capture</td>', 'lacking any really focusing, unfortunately as it could have been an exciting capture', '2006-02-07 07:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129044, 289299, 38032, '<td valign="top">this is different and intriquing</td>', 'this is different and intriquing', '2006-02-07 07:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129050, 280233, 38032, '<td valign="top">Some pictures of primates make you feel like you''re looking at a human.  This one does in a crazy way.  It''s kinda scary which gets you a 9 -- the rule of thirds is very apprent and working well here . Man that''s good.  I might have bumped up the black a tad and the title could have been less cliche.  But still - I think this should be int he top if it were up to me-  he looks like a friend! :)</td>', 'Some pictures of primates make you feel like you''re looking at a human.  This one does in a crazy way.  It''s kinda scary which gets you a 9 -- the rule of thirds is very apprent and working well here . Man that''s good.  I might have bumped up the black a tad and the title could have been less cliche.  But still - I think this should be int he top if it were up to me-  he looks like a friend! :)', '2006-02-07 07:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
