(2129456, 287636, 32084, '<td valign="top">What a spectacular moment to have captured.  Good job.  Much to improve however as bird photos are very tough to get right.  The white is very over-exposed as all detail is lost.  Try to meter on just the white areas and then stop down a little.  Also sharpness could be improved as the detail in the feathers has been lost.  Stick with it and I''m sure you will be rewarded with a treasure.</td>', 'What a spectacular moment to have captured.  Good job.  Much to improve however as bird photos are very tough to get right.  The white is very over-exposed as all detail is lost.  Try to meter on just the white areas and then stop down a little.  Also sharpness could be improved as the detail in the feathers has been lost.  Stick with it and I''m sure you will be rewarded with a treasure.', '2006-02-07 10:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
