(2129900, 288586, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I like the long exposure effect.  Also like the great color tone in  the sea and sky.  Very good!</td>', 'Great photo, I like the long exposure effect.  Also like the great color tone in  the sea and sky.  Very good!', '2006-02-07 14:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129904, 277754, 42100, '<td valign="top">I''m not a deep enough thinker to get the meaning...  but this is a very good photo.  Nice job!</td>', 'I''m not a deep enough thinker to get the meaning...  but this is a very good photo.  Nice job!', '2006-02-07 14:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129905, 288680, 42100, '<td valign="top">I like how the highlights at the top pushes the eye down into all activity of the mall.  Not a fan of the border though.  The sense of movement you''re creating in your current entries is really cool.  Great photo, keep up the good work!</td>', 'I like how the highlights at the top pushes the eye down into all activity of the mall.  Not a fan of the border though.  The sense of movement you''re creating in your current entries is really cool.  Great photo, keep up the good work!', '2006-02-07 14:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129906, 288493, 20530, '<td valign="top">What a nice, evocative image. Good choice of the blue. It creates a feeling of desolate solitude that one would expect to find in a cemetery. I''m seeing some artifacts, but that''s the only thing I can find wrong with this shot. Great job.</td>', 'What a nice, evocative image. Good choice of the blue. It creates a feeling of desolate solitude that one would expect to find in a cemetery. I''m seeing some artifacts, but that''s the only thing I can find wrong with this shot. Great job.', '2006-02-07 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129908, 288556, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  I like the pop of churches muted colors against the tones of the trees.  Very nice!</td>', 'Very good photo.  I like the pop of churches muted colors against the tones of the trees.  Very nice!', '2006-02-07 14:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129910, 286141, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very interesting colorings on this bird.  You captured those details very well!  Nice photo!</td>', 'Very interesting colorings on this bird.  You captured those details very well!  Nice photo!', '2006-02-07 14:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129912, 282524, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very original photograph.  I really like the out of the shadows composition,  Great job!</td>', 'Very original photograph.  I really like the out of the shadows composition,  Great job!', '2006-02-07 14:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129914, 280293, 20530, '<td valign="top">That''s interesting. The color pallete is lovely. Also like the movement created by the dock poles. Fascinating shot, although I''m seeing some artifacts that detract from it a bit.</td>', 'That''s interesting. The color pallete is lovely. Also like the movement created by the dock poles. Fascinating shot, although I''m seeing some artifacts that detract from it a bit.', '2006-02-07 14:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129930, 285921, 20530, '<td valign="top">My monitor doesn''t distiguish the black range very well. With that in mind, I still find myself wishing for a little more detail in this image. The concept and timing are good and the sky is really nice.</td>', 'My monitor doesn''t distiguish the black range very well. With that in mind, I still find myself wishing for a little more detail in this image. The concept and timing are good and the sky is really nice.', '2006-02-07 14:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129932, 284875, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very calm and beautiful.  Good colors and tones.  Great photo!</td>', 'Very calm and beautiful.  Good colors and tones.  Great photo!', '2006-02-07 14:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2129933, 277512, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail.  Postioning against the green background, really makes the little guy pop!  Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice detail.  Postioning against the green background, really makes the little guy pop!  Very nice!', '2006-02-07 14:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
