(2131056, 289264, 3214, '<td valign="top">This is a very appealing winter scene, the intricacy of the branches and texture in the trunk really draws my eye, and I like the minimal landscape at the bottom.</td>', 'This is a very appealing winter scene, the intricacy of the branches and texture in the trunk really draws my eye, and I like the minimal landscape at the bottom.', '2006-02-07 21:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
