(2131762, 278637, 27164, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, Neil!  I wonder how it would have looked in black and white?  I like the colorful sky, but I don''t particularly like the dull colors in the foreground.  The composition is quite dynamic and I like the nice sense asymmetrical balance.  Congrats on placing in the top 10 in such a competitive contest.</td>', 'Beautiful, Neil!  I wonder how it would have looked in black and white?  I like the colorful sky, but I don''t particularly like the dull colors in the foreground.  The composition is quite dynamic and I like the nice sense asymmetrical balance.  Congrats on placing in the top 10 in such a competitive contest.', '2006-02-08 00:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
