(2132542, 288830, 27482, '<td valign="top">The resemblance is striking, he really looks like you when I compare this to your other free study shot <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=263962" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/401/thumb/263962.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/401/thumb/263962.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/401/thumb/263962.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Anyway, congrats on your first and I am sure not your last ribbon :)  Go Iceland!</td>', 'The resemblance is striking, he really looks like you when I compare this to your other free study shot    Anyway, congrats on your first and I am sure not your last ribbon :)  Go Iceland!', '2006-02-08 03:57:38.000000', NULL, 0),
