(2132807, 280233, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  A very good capture and photograph.  The eyes ''follow you''.  Likely just not discernable at this size yet there in a larger format - but if just a bit more detail, would have made this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps also, a little looser crop at the bottom, if you had it to work with, obviously.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  A very good capture and photograph.  The eyes ''follow you''.  Likely just not discernable at this size yet there in a larger format - but if just a bit more detail, would have made this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps also, a little looser crop at the bottom, if you had it to work with, obviously.', '2006-02-08 06:45:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2132809, 283191, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6.  Liked the ''genuine'' feel to it.  The main criticism I had was the upper right half-a-person.  The grain ''worked'' and added some character and feel in this, but perhaps without it might have been better, not sure.</td>', 'I gave this a 6.  Liked the ''genuine'' feel to it.  The main criticism I had was the upper right half-a-person.  The grain ''worked'' and added some character and feel in this, but perhaps without it might have been better, not sure.', '2006-02-08 06:46:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2132830, 289221, 14386, '<td valign="top">I can only stare in amazement.  Excellent crop and great tones.  Love it. A fave.</td>', 'I can only stare in amazement.  Excellent crop and great tones.  Love it. A fave.', '2006-02-08 06:53:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2132831, 286554, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  Seemed a little too over-processed in my opinion, but I realize it was likely your intent.  I recall noticing how the horse''s mane looked shaved.  The shot looks like it is tilted, but just might be the perspective.  Possibly also incorporating a little more of the rider, if you had it, obviously, or just ''something'' to gain a little more balance, may have also made this better in my opinion.</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  Seemed a little too over-processed in my opinion, but I realize it was likely your intent.  I recall noticing how the horse''s mane looked shaved.  The shot looks like it is tilted, but just might be the perspective.  Possibly also incorporating a little more of the rider, if you had it, obviously, or just ''something'' to gain a little more balance, may have also made this better in my opinion.', '2006-02-08 06:53:22.000000', NULL, 0),
