(2132962, 289038, 36006, '<td valign="top">I liked it. Great comp, excellent b&amp;w, great color, great lines, small boobs, great flow, good texture, nice angle, love the shadowing there fore I love the light, great dof, overall could be a great print.<br/> <br/>Side note: A break is a good thing. To get your barrings, to be reenergized, to get inspiration. To quit would be to give in to the people that just don''t want to know. <br/> <br/>The ribbon winners are good photogs, but, an artist is memorable.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps.</td>', 'I liked it. Great comp, excellent b&w, great color, great lines, small boobs, great flow, good texture, nice angle, love the shadowing there fore I love the light, great dof, overall could be a great print. Side note: A break is a good thing. To get your barrings, to be reenergized, to get inspiration. To quit would be to give in to the people that just don''t want to know.  The ribbon winners are good photogs, but, an artist is memorable. Hope this helps.', '2006-02-08 07:37:40.000000', NULL, 0),
