(2133039, 283109, 37430, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the DPC Critique Club! <br/> <br/>...and I really did not do anything special to get all you images for critique :) <br/> <br/>Well...I''ll keep this one simple. I''m not too sure on whats the subject here - Flowers or model. But for sure - the presence of model in background enhances the presence of flower. Btw, I checked your other photos and I really envy you for getting hold of such gorgeous model. Coming back, somehow this is more of a flower picture because of the strong colors. Also if you carefully look at the model breast (ehm..;)), you can see it to be over-exposed (strictly in photographic terms :)) and details are burnt out. For this to be model picture the focus need to be sharp on face or any other "interesting" body part need to be center of (eye) focus.<br/> <br/>Overall a interesting picture. The setting seems to be good and offers potential of even better photo ...maybe with different angle or crop.</td>', 'Greetings from the DPC Critique Club!  ...and I really did not do anything special to get all you images for critique :)  Well...I''ll keep this one simple. I''m not too sure on whats the subject here - Flowers or model. But for sure - the presence of model in background enhances the presence of flower. Btw, I checked your other photos and I really envy you for getting hold of such gorgeous model. Coming back, somehow this is more of a flower picture because of the strong colors. Also if you carefully look at the model breast (ehm..;)), you can see it to be over-exposed (strictly in photographic terms :)) and details are burnt out. For this to be model picture the focus need to be sharp on face or any other "interesting" body part need to be center of (eye) focus. Overall a interesting picture. The setting seems to be good and offers potential of even better photo ...maybe with different angle or crop.', '2006-02-08 07:53:31.000000', NULL, 0),
