(2134149, 285462, 28963, '<td valign="top">Well I suppose the branches in the forground are somewhat distracting. I find the dynamics of the shot a bit off as well, the tree is too centered.<br/>The way I see this shot the rusted spike fence is the main subject so I would have liked to see some more of it.<br/>Very nice DOF and exposure.<br/>Hope it helps.<br/>P.s take everything with a grain of salt as I am scoring much lower the you on DPC... :-)</td>', 'Well I suppose the branches in the forground are somewhat distracting. I find the dynamics of the shot a bit off as well, the tree is too centered.The way I see this shot the rusted spike fence is the main subject so I would have liked to see some more of it.Very nice DOF and exposure.Hope it helps.P.s take everything with a grain of salt as I am scoring much lower the you on DPC... :-)', '2006-02-08 14:06:46.000000', NULL, 0),
