(2134805, 279615, 40718, '<td valign="top">To me, and I''m not an abstract affecianado, abstracts are about either color or pattern.  Here the color is nice (I like that color blue) but monotone and the pattern is chaotic.  I bet you would have done better by firing the shot in a more geometric fashion.  I''m not saying to perfectly line things up, but perhaps have them all oriented vertically or horizontally, or have them progress in a pattern as the move across the canvas.</td>', 'To me, and I''m not an abstract affecianado, abstracts are about either color or pattern.  Here the color is nice (I like that color blue) but monotone and the pattern is chaotic.  I bet you would have done better by firing the shot in a more geometric fashion.  I''m not saying to perfectly line things up, but perhaps have them all oriented vertically or horizontally, or have them progress in a pattern as the move across the canvas.', '2006-02-08 16:53:32.000000', NULL, 0),
