(2135556, 289312, 39664, '<td valign="top">I think this your best shot to date, Xuan.  I don''t get the idiots that gave this shot a one....trolls! (LOL! under a ''tridge!)</td>', 'I think this your best shot to date, Xuan.  I don''t get the idiots that gave this shot a one....trolls! (LOL! under a ''tridge!)', '2006-02-08 22:27:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135719, 279725, 3214, '<td valign="top">Yep, under-rated.  I gave it a 7.</td>', 'Yep, under-rated.  I gave it a 7.', '2006-02-08 23:28:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135786, 288830, 34171, '<td valign="top">Great shot and treatment.</td>', 'Great shot and treatment.', '2006-02-09 00:06:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135871, 287786, 43148, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, they are always appreciated. I tend to agree with philup about this one, I still think it is an excellent photo, but understood going in that a tree stork is NOT a beautiful, colorful bird and that would damper the votes to a certain extent. This is a young tree stork btw, and I really did see that title in this photo, the instant I looked at it on a puter! LOL The storks are fairly rare now, and I find that too bad, because I DO see beauty in them, and even intelligence in their eyes.<br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, they are always appreciated. I tend to agree with philup about this one, I still think it is an excellent photo, but understood going in that a tree stork is NOT a beautiful, colorful bird and that would damper the votes to a certain extent. This is a young tree stork btw, and I really did see that title in this photo, the instant I looked at it on a puter! LOL The storks are fairly rare now, and I find that too bad, because I DO see beauty in them, and even intelligence in their eyes. Jacque', '2006-02-09 00:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135922, 289002, 19708, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting and detail!!<br/>Congrats on your <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib1.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib1.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib1.gif"/> and your personal best Gisli !</td>', 'Amazing lighting and detail!!Congrats on your  and your personal best Gisli !', '2006-02-09 01:14:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135926, 285757, 19708, '<td valign="top">Amazingly simple and holds my attention, looking at the detail<br/>Congrats on your <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib2.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib2.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib2.gif"/> Jason and your new personal best!</td>', 'Amazingly simple and holds my attention, looking at the detailCongrats on your  Jason and your new personal best!', '2006-02-09 01:17:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135928, 288830, 19708, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib3.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib3.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/rib3.gif"/> Egill!<br/>This shot is amazing in it''s detail and tone. Superb job on the lighting too!</td>', 'Congrats on your first  Egill!This shot is amazing in it''s detail and tone. Superb job on the lighting too!', '2006-02-09 01:19:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135940, 289002, 17126, '<td valign="top">congrats, lovely.<br/> <br/>but is it just me, or is the horizon tilted a bit? I thought that while I was voting, also.</td>', 'congrats, lovely. but is it just me, or is the horizon tilted a bit? I thought that while I was voting, also.', '2006-02-09 01:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135952, 289200, 28742, '<td valign="top">Technically a good portrait, IMO. "Raw and honest" are great, but better if you were happier. :) I''m not thrilled with the hair in the face, but the clarity of the eyes makes up for it. Again though, I''d like to see you smiling even just a little.</td>', 'Technically a good portrait, IMO. "Raw and honest" are great, but better if you were happier. :) I''m not thrilled with the hair in the face, but the clarity of the eyes makes up for it. Again though, I''d like to see you smiling even just a little.', '2006-02-09 01:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135961, 284156, 37334, '<td valign="top">What a lovely emotive image. He has almost taken on the quality of a church statue or a cherub. Wonderful post processing.</td>', 'What a lovely emotive image. He has almost taken on the quality of a church statue or a cherub. Wonderful post processing.', '2006-02-09 01:50:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136025, 288830, 21816, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture. Well done on your ribbon. No offense to your dad but he looks a little like Donald Rumsfeld!!  Great photo!</td>', 'Fantastic picture. Well done on your ribbon. No offense to your dad but he looks a little like Donald Rumsfeld!!  Great photo!', '2006-02-09 02:30:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136115, 289363, 42125, '<td valign="top">Good fog capture. I think that if you would cut off the sky then the picture would be more mistified and better. The sky distracts.<br/>Easy to test, just by scrolling down a bit.</td>', 'Good fog capture. I think that if you would cut off the sky then the picture would be more mistified and better. The sky distracts.Easy to test, just by scrolling down a bit.', '2006-02-09 05:12:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136287, 288586, 24454, '<td valign="top">Congratulations not only on achieving a most impressive 5th place in this toughest of tough challenge!!!   But I notice on your profile you reached another of your 2006 goals in attaining a score over 7!  Way to go!   And this is certainly a deserving image!!   BEAUTIFULLY DONE!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations not only on achieving a most impressive 5th place in this toughest of tough challenge!!!   But I notice on your profile you reached another of your 2006 goals in attaining a score over 7!  Way to go!   And this is certainly a deserving image!!   BEAUTIFULLY DONE!! ', '2006-02-09 07:46:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136359, 284156, 15711, '<td valign="top">I didn''t comment on this during the challenge - so many entries, but I did vote it a 7.  It was different and almost nostalgic with the sense of grain, yet no sepia filter, which I liked.  Imaginative and artistic.</td>', 'I didn''t comment on this during the challenge - so many entries, but I did vote it a 7.  It was different and almost nostalgic with the sense of grain, yet no sepia filter, which I liked.  Imaginative and artistic.', '2006-02-09 08:28:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136404, 288742, 18728, '<td valign="top">Simply love it all, as it is. Its a beautiful picture that speaks volume....worth a thousand words :)</td>', 'Simply love it all, as it is. Its a beautiful picture that speaks volume....worth a thousand words :)', '2006-02-09 08:44:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136610, 280544, 35161, '<td valign="top">The tones of this shot are extraordinary! Compliments! :)</td>', 'The tones of this shot are extraordinary! Compliments! :)', '2006-02-09 10:42:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136656, 286141, 14603, '<td valign="top">Great image.<br/>Starlings are deceivingly colourful birds, when the light catches their plumage,they really sparkle.<br/>I see from most commenters that they appear unfamiliar with the bird,I assume that they are not as common in your part of the world.<br/> <br/>Common to the point of being considered pests in UK.<br/>Nicely captured.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great image.Starlings are deceivingly colourful birds, when the light catches their plumage,they really sparkle.I see from most commenters that they appear unfamiliar with the bird,I assume that they are not as common in your part of the world. Common to the point of being considered pests in UK.Nicely captured. ', '2006-02-09 11:08:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136743, 285757, 28710, '<td valign="top">What an amazing idea. Brilliant!</td>', 'What an amazing idea. Brilliant!', '2006-02-09 11:50:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136851, 288830, 4603, '<td valign="top">Til hamingju... massa mynd</td>', 'Til hamingju... massa mynd', '2006-02-09 12:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136924, 283109, 40718, '<td valign="top">Composition is excellent.  I like the crop a lot and I love her wistful look.  The sepia is restrained, although I''d like to see a B&amp;W as well to judge whether I like it better.  Perhaps the sepia is not the proper tone for her skin.  I''m glad the flowers don''t jump out in a blast of color.  They are subtle, although there are plenty here who do not like selective desat at all.  The biggest issue is the highlight on her right breast.  It is blown enough that we lack any definition.  If you stare long enough you can fool yourself that there is no breast there at all.  There is also a small smudge or shadow at the lower edge that distracts because the eye keeps asking "is that a nipple or not?"</td>', 'Composition is excellent.  I like the crop a lot and I love her wistful look.  The sepia is restrained, although I''d like to see a B&W as well to judge whether I like it better.  Perhaps the sepia is not the proper tone for her skin.  I''m glad the flowers don''t jump out in a blast of color.  They are subtle, although there are plenty here who do not like selective desat at all.  The biggest issue is the highlight on her right breast.  It is blown enough that we lack any definition.  If you stare long enough you can fool yourself that there is no breast there at all.  There is also a small smudge or shadow at the lower edge that distracts because the eye keeps asking "is that a nipple or not?"', '2006-02-09 13:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2136990, 288957, 24013, '<td valign="top">cool!  once i realized i was looking at a little face!  the truly good photos are "you either love it or you hate it"''s.  i love it and judging by the favourites i''m not alone.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-09 13:46:51.</i></td>', 'cool!  once i realized i was looking at a little face!  the truly good photos are "you either love it or you hate it"''s.  i love it and judging by the favourites i''m not alone.', '2006-02-09 13:43:58.000000', '2006-02-09 13:46:51.000000', 0),
(2137149, 280509, 23913, '<td valign="top">this was my fav. shot in the entire challenge, and u are on of my fav. photogs. on this whole site. really a shame that it didn''t place where it should''ve (top 3) but it really is beyond most cause u hit a true art shot here not stock or seen that before, but really a nice pice of art. great job.</td>', 'this was my fav. shot in the entire challenge, and u are on of my fav. photogs. on this whole site. really a shame that it didn''t place where it should''ve (top 3) but it really is beyond most cause u hit a true art shot here not stock or seen that before, but really a nice pice of art. great job.', '2006-02-09 14:58:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137182, 289221, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent stuff Skip. Keep it up superstar!</td>', 'Excellent stuff Skip. Keep it up superstar!', '2006-02-09 15:09:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137192, 289221, 48245, '<td valign="top">what kind of housing do you have for your camera?</td>', 'what kind of housing do you have for your camera?', '2006-02-09 15:13:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137199, 282756, 3569, '<td valign="top">Jim, My guess was right.  I spent a month in 82 counting hawks on the platform.  So know your great town well.  Want to come back some day.  Great capture.  I forgot there was water on that side of the lighthouse.  Van</td>', 'Jim, My guess was right.  I spent a month in 82 counting hawks on the platform.  So know your great town well.  Want to come back some day.  Great capture.  I forgot there was water on that side of the lighthouse.  Van', '2006-02-09 15:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137301, 288830, 34013, '<td valign="top">wow!</td>', 'wow!', '2006-02-09 15:48:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137306, 283216, 34013, '<td valign="top">i really love the softness of it. congrats on your top 10!</td>', 'i really love the softness of it. congrats on your top 10!', '2006-02-09 15:49:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137311, 288830, 31123, '<td valign="top">I''m very interested in where you bounced the flash and what other lighting you used. Great..GREAT shot.</td>', 'I''m very interested in where you bounced the flash and what other lighting you used. Great..GREAT shot.', '2006-02-09 15:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137328, 288662, 5792, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pix-are:</b></div><hr/><i> Horrible JPEG compression.  Great pic though.  However, the poor compression lowered my score.  3 </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Agree it is a nice image, disagree about there being jpeg compression artifacts. Not a one I can see. Good color and interesting foliage framing of the mushroom.</td>', 'Originally posted by pix-are: Horrible JPEG compression.  Great pic though.  However, the poor compression lowered my score.  3  Agree it is a nice image, disagree about there being jpeg compression artifacts. Not a one I can see. Good color and interesting foliage framing of the mushroom.', '2006-02-09 15:54:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137391, 289038, 40679, '<td valign="top">I really like the pink of the sheet, combined with the smooth skin. the colors &amp; soft lighting just fit perfectly. :)</td>', 'I really like the pink of the sheet, combined with the smooth skin. the colors & soft lighting just fit perfectly. :)', '2006-02-09 16:13:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137426, 275886, 49224, '<td valign="top">The shot was a difficult one taken from inside a very dimly lit building with really bright sunlight streaming in through the window behind the wheel. I found the contrast quite breath takeing. I think the softness of the focus comes because the wheel was actualy moving though rather slowly as it was connected to a large water wheel. I have to admit to being sad this didn''t get a better rating because it really was a difficult shot to take.</td>', 'The shot was a difficult one taken from inside a very dimly lit building with really bright sunlight streaming in through the window behind the wheel. I found the contrast quite breath takeing. I think the softness of the focus comes because the wheel was actualy moving though rather slowly as it was connected to a large water wheel. I have to admit to being sad this didn''t get a better rating because it really was a difficult shot to take.', '2006-02-09 16:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137504, 281732, 14603, '<td valign="top">Cityscapes can be hard to make interesting as they are done so often..but this one is very fresh and vibrant.<br/>Would make a great poster.<br/> <br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Cityscapes can be hard to make interesting as they are done so often..but this one is very fresh and vibrant.Would make a great poster. Nice work.', '2006-02-09 16:37:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137658, 288974, 45022, '<td valign="top">Thanks So Much for the Comments! They all were most helpful! I will be entering again, so keep your eye open :)! Thanks to all those who voted!</td>', 'Thanks So Much for the Comments! They all were most helpful! I will be entering again, so keep your eye open :)! Thanks to all those who voted!', '2006-02-09 17:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137856, 286141, 50127, '<td valign="top">I am SO happy to see this picture here in the top ten. Starlings are absolutely amazing birds.  Gorgeous AND intelligent.  I own two as pets and they just are wonderful animals.  They talk and everything!!<br/> <br/>Here in upstateNY (aka farm country) people view them in much the same way that people view pigeons in other parts of the country- ugly pests.  So glad to see this beautiful picture get so well recieved :)</td>', 'I am SO happy to see this picture here in the top ten. Starlings are absolutely amazing birds.  Gorgeous AND intelligent.  I own two as pets and they just are wonderful animals.  They talk and everything!! Here in upstateNY (aka farm country) people view them in much the same way that people view pigeons in other parts of the country- ugly pests.  So glad to see this beautiful picture get so well recieved :)', '2006-02-09 18:27:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137930, 286141, 27735, '<td valign="top">Thanks, I didn''t even know this was a starling when I took this photo in Washington DC while traveling for work. I haven''t seen starlings like this in California. Out here, sea gulls, pidgeons, and crows are the major pests. :-)<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rebs138:</b></div><hr/><i> I am SO happy to see this picture here in the top ten. Starlings are absolutely amazing birds.  Gorgeous AND intelligent.  I own two as pets and they just are wonderful animals.  They talk and everything!!<br/> <br/>Here in upstateNY (aka farm country) people view them in much the same way that people view pigeons in other parts of the country- ugly pests.  So glad to see this beautiful picture get so well recieved :) </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thanks, I didn''t even know this was a starling when I took this photo in Washington DC while traveling for work. I haven''t seen starlings like this in California. Out here, sea gulls, pidgeons, and crows are the major pests. :-) Originally posted by rebs138: I am SO happy to see this picture here in the top ten. Starlings are absolutely amazing birds.  Gorgeous AND intelligent.  I own two as pets and they just are wonderful animals.  They talk and everything!! Here in upstateNY (aka farm country) people view them in much the same way that people view pigeons in other parts of the country- ugly pests.  So glad to see this beautiful picture get so well recieved :) ', '2006-02-09 18:44:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137932, 288830, 25397, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done, and I love your PS work in this</td>', 'Extremely well done, and I love your PS work in this', '2006-02-09 18:44:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137967, 288493, 50127, '<td valign="top">I love crows :) <br/>I recently read a book and some experiments on their intelligence... its amazing how smart they are and hardly anyone gives them credit for it.<br/> <br/>One crow for sorrow<br/>Two crows for mirth<br/>three crows a wedding<br/>four crows a birth<br/>five crows for silver and<br/>six crows for gold<br/>seven crows a secret, not to be told<br/>eight crows for heaven<br/>nine crows for hell<br/>ten crows are the devil himself</td>', 'I love crows :) I recently read a book and some experiments on their intelligence... its amazing how smart they are and hardly anyone gives them credit for it. One crow for sorrowTwo crows for mirththree crows a weddingfour crows a birthfive crows for silver andsix crows for goldseven crows a secret, not to be toldeight crows for heavennine crows for hellten crows are the devil himself', '2006-02-09 18:53:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137991, 288493, 15711, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this during the challenge.  It is composed so well.  It reminds me of the not so famous painting by Claude Monet "The Magpie" with a single black bird in the snow.  The rows of tombstones create a linear quality and the filter just adds to the sad lonesome mood.  Not a bad placement, considering the number of entries.</td>', 'I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this during the challenge.  It is composed so well.  It reminds me of the not so famous painting by Claude Monet "The Magpie" with a single black bird in the snow.  The rows of tombstones create a linear quality and the filter just adds to the sad lonesome mood.  Not a bad placement, considering the number of entries.', '2006-02-09 19:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138000, 285187, 72317, '<td valign="top">A little too bright in the background for my taste, but a great shot, nonetheless! I love pictures that look like they''re from a place a little before my time, and I like things in black and white and speia one! Wonderfully done!</td>', 'A little too bright in the background for my taste, but a great shot, nonetheless! I love pictures that look like they''re from a place a little before my time, and I like things in black and white and speia one! Wonderfully done!', '2006-02-09 19:03:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138053, 289298, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great job on this and underated IMO.  10 from me and I wish it would have scored higher.  The eyes and the hand positioning are particularly nice.</td>', 'Great job on this and underated IMO.  10 from me and I wish it would have scored higher.  The eyes and the hand positioning are particularly nice.', '2006-02-09 19:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138060, 288202, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  The only comment/critisism i have(and its a nitpic one) is that the highlites on the stems and edges of some of the petals are really bright.  I switch back and forth between liking it for its high contrast and wishing it were toned down just a little.  Either way, its a great picture with good composition and color.</td>', 'Great picture.  The only comment/critisism i have(and its a nitpic one) is that the highlites on the stems and edges of some of the petals are really bright.  I switch back and forth between liking it for its high contrast and wishing it were toned down just a little.  Either way, its a great picture with good composition and color.', '2006-02-09 19:21:41.000000', NULL, 0),
