(2139856, 289236, 48471, '<td valign="top">Wow! Nice, lovely, beautiful. I love the colour of the skin, it looks like a classic painting. The red of lips also. It''s just the colour of the tongue that bothers me a bit. Congratulations on a nice piece of art. If I had a cafe-bar, I''d hang this in one of the walls.</td>', 'Wow! Nice, lovely, beautiful. I love the colour of the skin, it looks like a classic painting. The red of lips also. It''s just the colour of the tongue that bothers me a bit. Congratulations on a nice piece of art. If I had a cafe-bar, I''d hang this in one of the walls.', '2006-02-10 10:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
