(2144122, 282354, 32133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by trnqlty:</b></div><hr/><i> I suppose i could be wrong but this looks completely photoshopped, not genuine depth of field through a lens. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree.  It actually looked pretty good without gaussian blurring so much.  I just liked the effect.  Live and learn...</td>', 'Originally posted by trnqlty: I suppose i could be wrong but this looks completely photoshopped, not genuine depth of field through a lens.   I agree.  It actually looked pretty good without gaussian blurring so much.  I just liked the effect.  Live and learn...', '2006-02-12 08:21:11.000000', NULL, 0),
