(2146135, 280509, 5112, '<td valign="top">I just love this shot.  Stuff like this just doesn''t do all that well here, but it''s good, very good.<br/> <br/>You know, if you move the screen up and down while looking at the shot (scroll with the mouse), it looks like the raindrops are moving, like they''re just hitting the puddle.  It''s really neat.  You got me looking at bricks and mud now (OK, I was looking at them before, but I''m looking even more now).<br/> <br/>And it is upside down, right?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-13 00:59:30.</i></td>', 'I just love this shot.  Stuff like this just doesn''t do all that well here, but it''s good, very good. You know, if you move the screen up and down while looking at the shot (scroll with the mouse), it looks like the raindrops are moving, like they''re just hitting the puddle.  It''s really neat.  You got me looking at bricks and mud now (OK, I was looking at them before, but I''m looking even more now). And it is upside down, right?', '2006-02-13 00:58:09.000000', '2006-02-13 00:59:30.000000', 0),
