(2151863, 288619, 27164, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The only thing I would have done differently in the editing is either boosted the color or desaturated.  As it is now, I see a little bit of color, but I say all or nothing.  It seems a bit awkward to leave the photo like this, with a little bit of color but not enough to catch my eye.</td>', 'I really like this.  The only thing I would have done differently in the editing is either boosted the color or desaturated.  As it is now, I see a little bit of color, but I say all or nothing.  It seems a bit awkward to leave the photo like this, with a little bit of color but not enough to catch my eye.', '2006-02-15 01:46:31.000000', NULL, 0),
