(2190941, 284511, 44061, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Toyan:</b></div><hr/><i> the price is not 2M but 1.5M... :)<br/>Nice shot by the way! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL, 1.5M Euros.  That''s over $2M USD. Either way, I''ll probably never own one, and was just glad to see one up close.</td>', 'Originally posted by Toyan: the price is not 2M but 1.5M... :)Nice shot by the way!   LOL, 1.5M Euros.  That''s over $2M USD. Either way, I''ll probably never own one, and was just glad to see one up close.', '2006-02-28 23:07:13.000000', NULL, 0),
