(2221958, 281624, 33652, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. Excellent use of shadow and light, excelletn arrangement and composition, and a great choice for B&amp;W. Well done!<br/> <br/>(P.S. Thank you for your nice comment on my tryptic BTW! Isn''t the "Pick your favs" thread great?!)</td>', 'This is a great shot. Excellent use of shadow and light, excelletn arrangement and composition, and a great choice for B&W. Well done! (P.S. Thank you for your nice comment on my tryptic BTW! Isn''t the "Pick your favs" thread great?!)', '2006-03-12 14:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2222128, 280364, 7322, '<td valign="top">Wow! I wish I saw this during the voting. This is beautiful. I love this type of shot. I just entered something with a similar type of viewpoint in the Comfort challenge so it was cool to come across this so soon after. I like the grain and the slightly blown-out areas on the sink give this a natural appearance.</td>', 'Wow! I wish I saw this during the voting. This is beautiful. I love this type of shot. I just entered something with a similar type of viewpoint in the Comfort challenge so it was cool to come across this so soon after. I like the grain and the slightly blown-out areas on the sink give this a natural appearance.', '2006-03-12 16:00:34.000000', NULL, 0),
