(2228114, 288257, 34659, '<td valign="top">Again beautiful timing with your exposure for the water.  Lovely shot - except for the tree.  Anybody got an axe?  ;-P  Still a nice capture.</td>', 'Again beautiful timing with your exposure for the water.  Lovely shot - except for the tree.  Anybody got an axe?  ;-P  Still a nice capture.', '2006-03-14 21:24:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2231254, 283216, 21197, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful! I found it interesting that even @ 1/1600 Tv the wings still show motion; great job. Just enough motion any more it would have been too much - anyless and you end up with a static image.<br/> <br/>Great!<br/> <br/>-Rick</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful! I found it interesting that even @ 1/1600 Tv the wings still show motion; great job. Just enough motion any more it would have been too much - anyless and you end up with a static image. Great! -Rick', '2006-03-15 16:54:16.000000', NULL, 0),
