(2270722, 284362, 17446, '<td valign="top">I really like it upon my first impression.  Aquariums are not the easiest place to take photos due to the low light but you''ve done well.  Exposing for the whale and leaving the child''s silhouette was a nice choice.  I really like the deep blue tones that give a sense of depth to the water.  The fact that you captured the whale and child seemingly looking eye to eye is the best part.  If I had to change one thing, I would crop off the black bar at the bottom of the imgage.  Slightly distracting for me.  Nice job.<br/>Oh, and also, check out the similarities to this image of mine:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=195037" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17446/thumb/195037.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17446/thumb/195037.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/17446/thumb/195037.jpg"/></a> <br/>What are your thoughts?</td>', 'I really like it upon my first impression.  Aquariums are not the easiest place to take photos due to the low light but you''ve done well.  Exposing for the whale and leaving the child''s silhouette was a nice choice.  I really like the deep blue tones that give a sense of depth to the water.  The fact that you captured the whale and child seemingly looking eye to eye is the best part.  If I had to change one thing, I would crop off the black bar at the bottom of the imgage.  Slightly distracting for me.  Nice job.Oh, and also, check out the similarities to this image of mine: What are your thoughts?', '2006-03-29 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2270821, 284362, 49652, '<td valign="top">Terrific .. the whale looks so interested in the child.  I sort of like the dark bar at the bottom.  I agree that this would make a great postcard.</td>', 'Terrific .. the whale looks so interested in the child.  I sort of like the dark bar at the bottom.  I agree that this would make a great postcard.', '2006-03-29 16:38:05.000000', NULL, 0),
