(2330648, 287134, 34659, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I like the concept, the colors, the crispness/cleanness of it, and the lighting is excellent.  I''m not crazy about the double reflection (not sure why that occurred - opposing light sources?) and the crop does seem a bit tight.  That being said, I still scored it a 7 during the challenge.  Nice work.  :-)</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I like the concept, the colors, the crispness/cleanness of it, and the lighting is excellent.  I''m not crazy about the double reflection (not sure why that occurred - opposing light sources?) and the crop does seem a bit tight.  That being said, I still scored it a 7 during the challenge.  Nice work.  :-)', '2006-04-20 20:39:21.000000', NULL, 0),
