(2369714, 286248, 38198, '<td valign="top">Well I had an Idea, but I suck at comming up with a name for a photo. Well got alot of comments of "Photo not straight" My plan was to be slightly turnned. As you see the light is twisted, and I set all the books at an angle. I wanted to creat an unstable feeling. Maybe I did that just no one got that it was the point. Next time I will name the photo so the viewer will get what I am going for.</td>', 'Well I had an Idea, but I suck at comming up with a name for a photo. Well got alot of comments of "Photo not straight" My plan was to be slightly turnned. As you see the light is twisted, and I set all the books at an angle. I wanted to creat an unstable feeling. Maybe I did that just no one got that it was the point. Next time I will name the photo so the viewer will get what I am going for.', '2006-05-01 20:09:25.000000', NULL, 0),
