(2394278, 288948, 46778, '<td valign="top">I guess you got to be carefull how you show your models on DPC. I would have thought that this would do better, but the freestudys are tuff due to the large varity of entrys and everybody submitting their A game. If this is part of the setup, maybe the final pose would appeal better to the voters? Good job and good luck, I like your style.</td>', 'I guess you got to be carefull how you show your models on DPC. I would have thought that this would do better, but the freestudys are tuff due to the large varity of entrys and everybody submitting their A game. If this is part of the setup, maybe the final pose would appeal better to the voters? Good job and good luck, I like your style.', '2006-05-08 17:44:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2395713, 283938, 28710, '<td valign="top">ROFL! and I mean ROFL!<br/> <br/>This is so funny I think I''m going to send it to my mother.<br/> <br/>LOL! &lt;---- for about 2 minutes!<br/> <br/>It''s extra funny for me because I teach kids and they (being honest beyond a fault) always let me know that I am SOOOO FAT (probably a little less than your model, but not far off).<br/> <br/>Some older ones also let me know that too... I find the Taiwanese people to be very much like children in certain ways... It''s very endearing to be honest. Even criticism like that feels much softer because of the innocence with which it is delivered.<br/> <br/>Funny thing is, they often ask what month I am...<br/> <br/>I guess they are a little less used to generally porky guys...<br/> <br/>I play up on it of course to make them laugh... If you relax the stomach muscles, you can really get quite a paunch going!</td>', 'ROFL! and I mean ROFL! This is so funny I think I''m going to send it to my mother. LOL! <---- for about 2 minutes! It''s extra funny for me because I teach kids and they (being honest beyond a fault) always let me know that I am SOOOO FAT (probably a little less than your model, but not far off). Some older ones also let me know that too... I find the Taiwanese people to be very much like children in certain ways... It''s very endearing to be honest. Even criticism like that feels much softer because of the innocence with which it is delivered. Funny thing is, they often ask what month I am... I guess they are a little less used to generally porky guys... I play up on it of course to make them laugh... If you relax the stomach muscles, you can really get quite a paunch going!', '2006-05-09 02:56:03.000000', NULL, 0),
