(2413104, 289221, 27763, '<td valign="top">Really a cool shot.  Glad to see it did so well.  Congrats on fourth place in a free study!</td>', 'Really a cool shot.  Glad to see it did so well.  Congrats on fourth place in a free study!', '2006-05-13 23:40:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2413229, 289221, 24111, '<td valign="top">WOW! great work</td>', 'WOW! great work', '2006-05-14 00:19:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2413557, 277165, 36628, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture with the colors machenery reflected in the water. I think the water is my favorite part because the colors are much richer and a little bit toned down from the sky, which has that very bright highlight. If you were ever going to re-precess this as a non-challenge entry, I think it would look amazing if you combined two exposures from the raw, making one alot darker to bring some more detail back to the sky. With such a big dynamic range in the shot, though I think this did a great job. The only other thing you might do would be to crop a bit off the top. The big patch of blue leaves an open space that is a little distracting to the eye.</td>', 'This is a great capture with the colors machenery reflected in the water. I think the water is my favorite part because the colors are much richer and a little bit toned down from the sky, which has that very bright highlight. If you were ever going to re-precess this as a non-challenge entry, I think it would look amazing if you combined two exposures from the raw, making one alot darker to bring some more detail back to the sky. With such a big dynamic range in the shot, though I think this did a great job. The only other thing you might do would be to crop a bit off the top. The big patch of blue leaves an open space that is a little distracting to the eye.', '2006-05-14 02:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2414890, 277754, 37779, '<td valign="top">Great photo, and great song that inspired the title! (Didn''t know too many people knew of Ms. Nordeman) Most excellent, dude.</td>', 'Great photo, and great song that inspired the title! (Didn''t know too many people knew of Ms. Nordeman) Most excellent, dude.', '2006-05-14 18:12:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2417986, 288586, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful image Mark. Congratulations! My only nitpick would be the left side of the lighthouse looks a tiny bit overexposed. That''s probably due to size of the image. You loose so much detail by shrinking an image to fit DPC''s stupid pixel limitations that you''re left with only a suggestion of the actual image. When I shrink a photo from my 5D I end up with less than 15% of the original pixels.<br/> <br/>Anyway, this is a sweet shot.<br/></td>', 'This is beautiful image Mark. Congratulations! My only nitpick would be the left side of the lighthouse looks a tiny bit overexposed. That''s probably due to size of the image. You loose so much detail by shrinking an image to fit DPC''s stupid pixel limitations that you''re left with only a suggestion of the actual image. When I shrink a photo from my 5D I end up with less than 15% of the original pixels. Anyway, this is a sweet shot.', '2006-05-15 16:04:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2424612, 278763, 8367, '<td valign="top">A beautiful capture. Congratulations on top ten and great score!</td>', 'A beautiful capture. Congratulations on top ten and great score!', '2006-05-17 10:34:55.000000', NULL, 0),
