(2688838, 288204, 63131, '<td valign="top">I really dig this shot. I have a similar shot of me wearing a red bra... but I think it lost something in the translation. LOL Seriously though... really compelling photo.</td>', 'I really dig this shot. I have a similar shot of me wearing a red bra... but I think it lost something in the translation. LOL Seriously though... really compelling photo.', '2006-08-02 15:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2707857, 288598, 12253, '<td valign="top">That''s a great shot Ray!  Love the composition and the wide angle effect.   I''m not bothered by the slightly overexposed areas called out in some of the comments--it actually adds to the effect, and they certainly give it a crisp contrast.  But if you wanted to, adjust this, you could try duplicating the layer and setting the blend to multiply.  This can work but only if it''s slightly overexposed.  In that case, if there''s detail in the hotter areas of snow or sky, that can bring them out.   <br/> <br/>Wonderful shot!</td>', 'That''s a great shot Ray!  Love the composition and the wide angle effect.   I''m not bothered by the slightly overexposed areas called out in some of the comments--it actually adds to the effect, and they certainly give it a crisp contrast.  But if you wanted to, adjust this, you could try duplicating the layer and setting the blend to multiply.  This can work but only if it''s slightly overexposed.  In that case, if there''s detail in the hotter areas of snow or sky, that can bring them out.    Wonderful shot!', '2006-08-08 22:46:05.000000', NULL, 0),
