(3811364, 289221, 69673, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, for one because you changed it to black and white which adds to the shot so much and the bubbles down the middle of the picture are awesome especially since you changed to B&amp;W it makes the bubbles "pop" even more!  Great shot!!</td>', 'I love this shot, for one because you changed it to black and white which adds to the shot so much and the bubbles down the middle of the picture are awesome especially since you changed to B&W it makes the bubbles "pop" even more!  Great shot!!', '2007-06-20 22:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
