(3918325, 289371, 52439, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but i agree with Germaine, it could do with being alot sharper all round, as the foreground to the left is really soft its quite off putting for me.</td>', 'Lovely shot, but i agree with Germaine, it could do with being alot sharper all round, as the foreground to the left is really soft its quite off putting for me.', '2007-07-19 13:03:21.000000', NULL, 0);
