(5746615, 287027, 98339, '<td valign="top">I recently tried to take a picture of this...it turned out ok, but I wanted to return back to take another picture 1/2 days later...and the flower was gone...they must be a short lived flower...this is very beautiful...I am wondering what SFW means.  How did you get the background so black?</td>', 'I recently tried to take a picture of this...it turned out ok, but I wanted to return back to take another picture 1/2 days later...and the flower was gone...they must be a short lived flower...this is very beautiful...I am wondering what SFW means.  How did you get the background so black?', '2009-11-30 09:22:07.000000', NULL, 0),
